(1225412, 154860, 10170, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, other than the blood looks a little too red/bright making it look false.  Other than that I love it.  Good luck with the DPC censors though, I can see some people objecting to this unfortunately.</td>', 'Nicely done, other than the blood looks a little too red/bright making it look false.  Other than that I love it.  Good luck with the DPC censors though, I can see some people objecting to this unfortunately.', '2005-03-14 00:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1225424, 155092, 30251, '<td valign="top">At first I wasn''t sure about this shot, then I came back to it and there is something really appealing about it. I like the feel, and I think I''ve walked past this bike before. Good luck, this is a good photograph.</td>', 'At first I wasn''t sure about this shot, then I came back to it and there is something really appealing about it. I like the feel, and I think I''ve walked past this bike before. Good luck, this is a good photograph.', '2005-03-14 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
