(1225522, 155194, 8891, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....interesting to say the very least. Never tried it at night, but then I usually don''t have my tripod with me. The white balance is about what I would get. Interesting how close your were to the BLue X building. Like the angle from there very much.  Good luck!</td>', 'Hmmm....interesting to say the very least. Never tried it at night, but then I usually don''t have my tripod with me. The white balance is about what I would get. Interesting how close your were to the BLue X building. Like the angle from there very much.  Good luck!', '2005-03-14 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
