(1226523, 154981, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is a really lovely image... the pixels and noise are a bit distracting though. One thing I do  find with digital cameras is you have to watch your ISO settings. Try to set it at the lowest (50 or 100) and this pixel problem will probably go away. I really like the colours in this.</td>', 'This is a really lovely image... the pixels and noise are a bit distracting though. One thing I do  find with digital cameras is you have to watch your ISO settings. Try to set it at the lowest (50 or 100) and this pixel problem will probably go away. I really like the colours in this.', '2005-03-14 12:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
