(1226732, 155519, 24511, '<td valign="top">This is my second blur effect photo and I just enjoy clear focus over abstract.  Sometimes I surprise myself in liking them but not this time.  Exellent light, shadow and reflexion.  Seeing is believing and I have to "leap of faith" and vote on gut instinct rather than on the visual.  I pray you get better than my 4.</td>', 'This is my second blur effect photo and I just enjoy clear focus over abstract.  Sometimes I surprise myself in liking them but not this time.  Exellent light, shadow and reflexion.  Seeing is believing and I have to "leap of faith" and vote on gut instinct rather than on the visual.  I pray you get better than my 4.', '2005-03-14 13:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
