(1226739, 155499, 33435, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Here is a tip that I like to do to my images with cropping, and this is a matter of my own personal taste.  See where on the top left, your diagonal line comes in?  I would crop the image from the top to have that line come in from the corner.  Experiment with it.  I think you''ll see that a couple of other lines, line up pretty well and make the image more geometrically pleasing.  Still, that is just my taste and I''m giving you a 10.  Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Here is a tip that I like to do to my images with cropping, and this is a matter of my own personal taste.  See where on the top left, your diagonal line comes in?  I would crop the image from the top to have that line come in from the corner.  Experiment with it.  I think you''ll see that a couple of other lines, line up pretty well and make the image more geometrically pleasing.  Still, that is just my taste and I''m giving you a 10.  Nice job!', '2005-03-14 13:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
