(1226905, 155498, 33435, '<td valign="top">Its a beautiful shot, but the pose doesn''t look natural, if that is what you were going for.  I ''m giving this a 7, and that has nothing to do about my comments regarding the pose.  More focus could have been on lines.</td>', 'Its a beautiful shot, but the pose doesn''t look natural, if that is what you were going for.  I ''m giving this a 7, and that has nothing to do about my comments regarding the pose.  More focus could have been on lines.', '2005-03-14 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
