(1226910, 155625, 33435, '<td valign="top">I never deduct points because of titles, but isn''t polyphonic a number of simultaneous sounds/tones?  I''m not getting sound or music from this photo.  Its a bit grainy and distorted in the upper right.  Nice entry though. 6</td>', 'I never deduct points because of titles, but isn''t polyphonic a number of simultaneous sounds/tones?  I''m not getting sound or music from this photo.  Its a bit grainy and distorted in the upper right.  Nice entry though. 6', '2005-03-14 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1226917, 154747, 26475, '<td valign="top">the horizon is a line, yes, but it''s not the emphasis of the photo. However, this is a spectacular shot, and the waves themselves have lines, so although I would under other circumstances give it a "10", I can only at this point give it a "9". Great photo!</td>', 'the horizon is a line, yes, but it''s not the emphasis of the photo. However, this is a spectacular shot, and the waves themselves have lines, so although I would under other circumstances give it a "10", I can only at this point give it a "9". Great photo!', '2005-03-14 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
