(1226987, 153757, 2490, '<td valign="top">Ooh, cool, and great texture.  Good background blur.  Just due to the nature of ice photography, though, the foreground doesn''t feel completly focused, and that bothers my eye.  7</td>', 'Ooh, cool, and great texture.  Good background blur.  Just due to the nature of ice photography, though, the foreground doesn''t feel completly focused, and that bothers my eye.  7', '2005-03-14 14:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
