(1226992, 155591, 2490, '<td valign="top">Obvious lines, but it feels a bit too "half and half".  Cropping out at least half of the sky really helps this photo a lot.  The sky is pretty, but it ruins the "lines".  5</td>', 'Obvious lines, but it feels a bit too "half and half".  Cropping out at least half of the sky really helps this photo a lot.  The sky is pretty, but it ruins the "lines".  5', '2005-03-14 14:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
