(1227011, 154504, 2490, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as a professional shot, but it doesn''t feel like "Lines" to me, even though I understand that mesh is a network of lines.  Sorry.  6</td>', 'This strikes me as a professional shot, but it doesn''t feel like "Lines" to me, even though I understand that mesh is a network of lines.  Sorry.  6', '2005-03-14 15:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
