(1227045, 154438, 2490, '<td valign="top">Lotsa lines good DOF.  I''m very impressed with this shot.  For technical excellence, it''s a winner IMO.  For theme, it''s a winner.  I say it''s a 10.  Good luck!  The foreground is a TOUCH overcontrasted on the red ear.  10</td>', 'Lotsa lines good DOF.  I''m very impressed with this shot.  For technical excellence, it''s a winner IMO.  For theme, it''s a winner.  I say it''s a 10.  Good luck!  The foreground is a TOUCH overcontrasted on the red ear.  10', '2005-03-14 15:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227046, 155230, 2490, '<td valign="top">Those are definitely lines :)  6</td>', 'Those are definitely lines :)  6', '2005-03-14 15:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227047, 155744, 2490, '<td valign="top">Foreground detail would have made me like this a little better. 6</td>', 'Foreground detail would have made me like this a little better. 6', '2005-03-14 15:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227048, 155533, 2490, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The glare is a bit bothersome, and the BW conversion steals something.  Not sure what, though. 6</td>', 'Nice!  The glare is a bit bothersome, and the BW conversion steals something.  Not sure what, though. 6', '2005-03-14 15:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227049, 155282, 2490, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I like this one. 9</td>', 'Yeah, I like this one. 9', '2005-03-14 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
