(1227274, 155276, 33560, '<td valign="top">At first I though I didn''t like it because I''m not a fan of aqua in flowers and aqua, in my opinion, clashes with dove gray.  I keep wondering whether the photo might  not be a bit better when that single  s -shaped petal is in focus, and when levels are adjusted so the whole background is white.</td>', 'At first I though I didn''t like it because I''m not a fan of aqua in flowers and aqua, in my opinion, clashes with dove gray.  I keep wondering whether the photo might  not be a bit better when that single  s -shaped petal is in focus, and when levels are adjusted so the whole background is white.', '2005-03-14 17:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
