(1227377, 155520, 8054, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this a lot. The contradicting straight lines and right angles vs the curves of the female form are very interesting. Sort of like the yin and yang of architectural styles, total opposites yet both have their place and can both be aestheticlly pleasing. The only thing that bothers me is the green tint. I think this would have looked better as pure b/w or maybe even sepia but I''m not too keen on the "Matrix" style coloring. 8</td>', 'I love the composition of this a lot. The contradicting straight lines and right angles vs the curves of the female form are very interesting. Sort of like the yin and yang of architectural styles, total opposites yet both have their place and can both be aestheticlly pleasing. The only thing that bothers me is the green tint. I think this would have looked better as pure b/w or maybe even sepia but I''m not too keen on the "Matrix" style coloring. 8', '2005-03-14 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227378, 153914, 12571, '<td valign="top">love the door but I would have cropped out the dirty spot at the bottom</td>', 'love the door but I would have cropped out the dirty spot at the bottom', '2005-03-14 17:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227379, 155412, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the pole and its color and texture relationship to the sky.  I love the tangle of manmade wires..  I''m afraid that the tangle of vines strikes me as  ... too tangled.</td>', 'I love the pole and its color and texture relationship to the sky.  I love the tangle of manmade wires..  I''m afraid that the tangle of vines strikes me as  ... too tangled.', '2005-03-14 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227382, 155353, 34217, '<td valign="top">great idea, but it seems to be lacking in quality, I am not sure if it is your camera, or if you increased your files size??</td>', 'great idea, but it seems to be lacking in quality, I am not sure if it is your camera, or if you increased your files size??', '2005-03-14 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227383, 155756, 12571, '<td valign="top">good concept but the thing at the top is distracting and it''s a shame the noose doesn''t "hang" better. lol</td>', 'good concept but the thing at the top is distracting and it''s a shame the noose doesn''t "hang" better. lol', '2005-03-14 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
