(1227392, 154259, 16912, '<td valign="top">I hope you went back to reshoot and this isn''t someone that knew the location?  I''ve recalibrated my monitor but the yellow seems lighter in this shot.  Simple, crisp and clean lines. Imho I think cropping up to the pavement would make this shot better.</td>', 'I hope you went back to reshoot and this isn''t someone that knew the location?  I''ve recalibrated my monitor but the yellow seems lighter in this shot.  Simple, crisp and clean lines. Imho I think cropping up to the pavement would make this shot better.', '2005-03-14 17:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
