(1227447, 154259, 8054, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant colors here. The shadows cast by the telephone lines (I think) are a nice contrast to the horizontal lines of the wall. Overall, image seems a bit unfocused. Clear details of the wall and telephone booth seem to be lost. The top edge of the bricks appear to be tilted towards the left or counterclockwise. Maybe the wall isn''t even or level.</td>', 'Love the vibrant colors here. The shadows cast by the telephone lines (I think) are a nice contrast to the horizontal lines of the wall. Overall, image seems a bit unfocused. Clear details of the wall and telephone booth seem to be lost. The top edge of the bricks appear to be tilted towards the left or counterclockwise. Maybe the wall isn''t even or level.', '2005-03-14 17:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227455, 154893, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting effect. I like the orange and aqua light.  The zoom lines powerfully enhance the division between ''above'' and ''below.''</td>', 'It''s an interesting effect. I like the orange and aqua light.  The zoom lines powerfully enhance the division between ''above'' and ''below.''', '2005-03-14 17:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
