(1227491, 154747, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic action shot.  The top half of the photo seems like wasted space to me.  It''s out of focus, and it adds no value to the photo.  In fact,  I think there is more drama if the surfer is high in the photo.</td>', 'This is a fantastic action shot.  The top half of the photo seems like wasted space to me.  It''s out of focus, and it adds no value to the photo.  In fact,  I think there is more drama if the surfer is high in the photo.', '2005-03-14 17:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227495, 155109, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the strong lines and the texture of the wood.  I like the choice to overexpose the background.  It''s a little high key for my taste - I''d have loved for there to be some nice dark shadows.</td>', 'I love the strong lines and the texture of the wood.  I like the choice to overexpose the background.  It''s a little high key for my taste - I''d have loved for there to be some nice dark shadows.', '2005-03-14 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227498, 155429, 33560, '<td valign="top">The sweep of the road is nice, but most of the rest of the photo strikes me as confusing and - you didn''t build those houses on the hill - ugly.</td>', 'The sweep of the road is nice, but most of the rest of the photo strikes me as confusing and - you didn''t build those houses on the hill - ugly.', '2005-03-14 18:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
