(1227505, 154277, 7599, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like that you opted not to shoot dead even with the columns, it adds an interesting perspective.  If I were being picky and trying to say something constructive, the only thing I would have tried would be to add a bit more contrast for drama. Honestly though,  it may or may not improve the image, it would have been something to play with for future consideration.</td>', 'Very nice. I like that you opted not to shoot dead even with the columns, it adds an interesting perspective.  If I were being picky and trying to say something constructive, the only thing I would have tried would be to add a bit more contrast for drama. Honestly though,  it may or may not improve the image, it would have been something to play with for future consideration.', '2005-03-14 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227506, 154063, 16106, '<td valign="top">Good tones but a touch soft in focus</td>', 'Good tones but a touch soft in focus', '2005-03-14 18:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
