(1227512, 155745, 7599, '<td valign="top">An unusual bird shot which I like for the purposes of the challenge. It would have been nice to see slighly more of the top of the wing (which has better detail) rather then the bottom.  I''m guessing thought this was a one in a million shot, so you probably didn''t have a chance to adjust your location.</td>', 'An unusual bird shot which I like for the purposes of the challenge. It would have been nice to see slighly more of the top of the wing (which has better detail) rather then the bottom.  I''m guessing thought this was a one in a million shot, so you probably didn''t have a chance to adjust your location.', '2005-03-14 18:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227513, 155424, 33560, '<td valign="top">I understand the reason, but I disagree with the choice.  The image of the background is too powerful to treat like this.  The subject, in all it''s sharply focused glory doesn''t stand a chance.  That''s doubly true when it lives where several majof lines in the background cross.</td>', 'I understand the reason, but I disagree with the choice.  The image of the background is too powerful to treat like this.  The subject, in all it''s sharply focused glory doesn''t stand a chance.  That''s doubly true when it lives where several majof lines in the background cross.', '2005-03-14 18:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
