(1227540, 154284, 7599, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, meets the challenge no problem. For a bit more punch I think I would have picked a different surface to line the cookies up on.  I would have gone with one colour, bright, but not in the brown family, so that the cookies really stood out.  It''s a hard "subject" to make interesting enough that the viewer doesn''t just pass it by.</td>', 'Cute picture, meets the challenge no problem. For a bit more punch I think I would have picked a different surface to line the cookies up on.  I would have gone with one colour, bright, but not in the brown family, so that the cookies really stood out.  It''s a hard "subject" to make interesting enough that the viewer doesn''t just pass it by.', '2005-03-14 18:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
