(1227564, 154860, 7599, '<td valign="top">Man are you ever going to get reamed by the soccer moms.  It''s gritty and I like the majority of it but honestly I think it would have been more dramatic if you hadn''t made the blood red. Sometimes subtle is far more effective then in your face. Also the angle on her arm makes her hand fairly large. Overall good use of props, great lighting, love the fact you left grain.</td>', 'Man are you ever going to get reamed by the soccer moms.  It''s gritty and I like the majority of it but honestly I think it would have been more dramatic if you hadn''t made the blood red. Sometimes subtle is far more effective then in your face. Also the angle on her arm makes her hand fairly large. Overall good use of props, great lighting, love the fact you left grain.', '2005-03-14 18:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
