(1227603, 155635, 7599, '<td valign="top">In this challenge I commented on another picture that it was a nice modern urban feeling shot, but that it lacked interest. This shot falls into the same category as urban and modern, but whatever was missing from the other shot, this one has. I thing it''s great! Colours are wonderful, excellent lighting and the people add appeal. I wouldn''t change a thing about it.</td>', 'In this challenge I commented on another picture that it was a nice modern urban feeling shot, but that it lacked interest. This shot falls into the same category as urban and modern, but whatever was missing from the other shot, this one has. I thing it''s great! Colours are wonderful, excellent lighting and the people add appeal. I wouldn''t change a thing about it.', '2005-03-14 18:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
