(1227730, 154697, 33145, '<td valign="top">This is dark, with a blue color cast and muddled. I don''t know what to look at or where you want me to look. The composition has no real thought in it with everything cropped. If your taken on lines is the telephone line then I don''t think you have captured it very well. If I was going to say something positive about this shot it''s that the writing is in focus. 2.</td>', 'This is dark, with a blue color cast and muddled. I don''t know what to look at or where you want me to look. The composition has no real thought in it with everything cropped. If your taken on lines is the telephone line then I don''t think you have captured it very well. If I was going to say something positive about this shot it''s that the writing is in focus. 2.', '2005-03-14 18:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
