(1227734, 155713, 33560, '<td valign="top">Exposure, and color seem wrong.  Also, it''s a bit of a static pose.  Yes, It''s hard to believe but there must be sixty four ways of making sliced bread more dynamic.</td>', 'Exposure, and color seem wrong.  Also, it''s a bit of a static pose.  Yes, It''s hard to believe but there must be sixty four ways of making sliced bread more dynamic.', '2005-03-14 18:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
