(1227739, 155209, 33145, '<td valign="top">Ok, the lines are in the field yes? If thats the case then it''s very blurry. The trees and the sky and buildings don''t add anything to the shot and could have been cropped out. Maybe a slight horizontal rotation to the left to straighten the shot. It''s main downfall however is the focus. I gave it a 2.</td>', 'Ok, the lines are in the field yes? If thats the case then it''s very blurry. The trees and the sky and buildings don''t add anything to the shot and could have been cropped out. Maybe a slight horizontal rotation to the left to straighten the shot. It''s main downfall however is the focus. I gave it a 2.', '2005-03-14 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227740, 155464, 12571, '<td valign="top">great detail</td>', 'great detail', '2005-03-14 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
