(1227753, 155455, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting building and a good shot of it.  Yet there is something very ordinary about it.</td>', 'It''s an interesting building and a good shot of it.  Yet there is something very ordinary about it.', '2005-03-14 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227754, 154949, 33145, '<td valign="top">Reasons I scored this a 3:<br/>A lot of color noise giving it an overly grainy feel for a color shot.<br/>The distracting black background against the white foreground is too much for the subject to make an impact.<br/>The lines on the paper have almost no impact other than to make the shot look cluttered - am I looking at the lines or the marker lids?<br/>The pink lid is almost out of shot.<br/>You could have inceased the aperture to a higher number (like f22) to get a greater DOF, thus making all of the lids in focus.<br/>What I liked: the vivid color - thats about it.</td>', 'Reasons I scored this a 3:A lot of color noise giving it an overly grainy feel for a color shot.The distracting black background against the white foreground is too much for the subject to make an impact.The lines on the paper have almost no impact other than to make the shot look cluttered - am I looking at the lines or the marker lids?The pink lid is almost out of shot.You could have inceased the aperture to a higher number (like f22) to get a greater DOF, thus making all of the lids in focus.What I liked: the vivid color - thats about it.', '2005-03-14 18:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227757, 154394, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great image.  I just wish you''d used a jug that didn''t have measurements marked on it.  They are a little distracting.</td>', 'Great image.  I just wish you''d used a jug that didn''t have measurements marked on it.  They are a little distracting.', '2005-03-14 18:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227758, 155087, 33560, '<td valign="top">Miles Davis is said to have ''played the spaces between the notes,''  This reminds me of that.</td>', 'Miles Davis is said to have ''played the spaces between the notes,''  This reminds me of that.', '2005-03-14 18:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227760, 154960, 33145, '<td valign="top">This shot is confused by several elements. Firstly the lower left corner and the top left of the frame where the blurred foreground should have been cropped out. The over saturation of the colors makes the pool fence and the wooden area hard to recognise.</td>', 'This shot is confused by several elements. Firstly the lower left corner and the top left of the frame where the blurred foreground should have been cropped out. The over saturation of the colors makes the pool fence and the wooden area hard to recognise.', '2005-03-14 18:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227764, 155476, 33560, '<td valign="top">The cracks in the ice and the spherical floats are very photogenic.  So, too is the hull of the nearest boat.  Pretty much everything else detracts from the photo IMO.</td>', 'The cracks in the ice and the spherical floats are very photogenic.  So, too is the hull of the nearest boat.  Pretty much everything else detracts from the photo IMO.', '2005-03-14 18:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227766, 155421, 33145, '<td valign="top">Having the dark subject (the fret board) shot against the dark background doesn''t help this shot. The fingers look a little lacking in detail and a softer brighter light source would have helped with this.</td>', 'Having the dark subject (the fret board) shot against the dark background doesn''t help this shot. The fingers look a little lacking in detail and a softer brighter light source would have helped with this.', '2005-03-14 18:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227767, 155129, 33560, '<td valign="top">Love the colors!   Nice composition, though perhaps a bit static.</td>', 'Love the colors!   Nice composition, though perhaps a bit static.', '2005-03-14 18:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227771, 155629, 33560, '<td valign="top">Clever, cute, but it just seems a little too vacuous.</td>', 'Clever, cute, but it just seems a little too vacuous.', '2005-03-14 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227773, 155129, 27605, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple, very nice.  ...7...</td>', 'Clean and simple, very nice.  ...7...', '2005-03-14 19:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227776, 155353, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sharpening was a requirement to bring out the strong texture of the skin, yet I''m finding it just a little too strong, a little too distracting.</td>', 'Sharpening was a requirement to bring out the strong texture of the skin, yet I''m finding it just a little too strong, a little too distracting.', '2005-03-14 19:04:05.000000', NULL, 1);
