(1227779, 155388, 33560, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too many.</td>', 'Perhaps too many.', '2005-03-14 19:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227786, 155597, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit heavy handed with the postprocessing for such a pastoral scene. I think i like what is under the modifications, though to see though.</td>', 'A bit heavy handed with the postprocessing for such a pastoral scene. I think i like what is under the modifications, though to see though.', '2005-03-14 19:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227788, 155498, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful and provocative pose  in a pleasing environment.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful and provocative pose  in a pleasing environment.', '2005-03-14 19:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227790, 155428, 18870, '<td valign="top">too much water from the spray bottle</td>', 'too much water from the spray bottle', '2005-03-14 19:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227791, 154860, 16106, '<td valign="top">wayyy over the top. Going for a "marat Sade vibe I would guess but a bit of subtelty mihgt have helped.</td>', 'wayyy over the top. Going for a "marat Sade vibe I would guess but a bit of subtelty mihgt have helped.', '2005-03-14 19:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227792, 155102, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The lines of the lights are quite good enough, but the bridge is icing on the cake.</td>', 'Very nice.  The lines of the lights are quite good enough, but the bridge is icing on the cake.', '2005-03-14 19:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227794, 155421, 31606, '<td valign="top">You lost parts of the strings.</td>', 'You lost parts of the strings.', '2005-03-14 19:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227795, 155102, 16106, '<td valign="top">wow I have enjoyed some of the other auto light lines, but with the bridge this is the best so far. Too bad about the lamps on the left, a bit distrqacting but that is a minor quibble</td>', 'wow I have enjoyed some of the other auto light lines, but with the bridge this is the best so far. Too bad about the lamps on the left, a bit distrqacting but that is a minor quibble', '2005-03-14 19:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227797, 155106, 31606, '<td valign="top">I think you uploaded the wrong photo or titled it wrong.  I don''t like the dark part in the bottom left.</td>', 'I think you uploaded the wrong photo or titled it wrong.  I don''t like the dark part in the bottom left.', '2005-03-14 19:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227799, 154263, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am bothered by the fact that the tip of his nose is out of focus.  It''s crazy; who cares.  Yet, it''s such a prominent feature, and everything else is sharp..  I''m also bothered by the blackness around the eye in the shadow would have loved to see some detail here. I suppose in this strong lighting the choice was either lose detail in shadows or blow the highlights, and in the end, this is the right choice.<br/> <br/>It''s a haunting image - a really strong model with a really strong expression.</td>', 'I am bothered by the fact that the tip of his nose is out of focus.  It''s crazy; who cares.  Yet, it''s such a prominent feature, and everything else is sharp..  I''m also bothered by the blackness around the eye in the shadow would have loved to see some detail here. I suppose in this strong lighting the choice was either lose detail in shadows or blow the highlights, and in the end, this is the right choice. It''s a haunting image - a really strong model with a really strong expression.', '2005-03-14 19:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227800, 155657, 33560, '<td valign="top">And that''s the problem.</td>', 'And that''s the problem.', '2005-03-14 19:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227801, 155657, 25787, '<td valign="top">It would be much better if it were level.  You can rotate a little with crop in photoshop.</td>', 'It would be much better if it were level.  You can rotate a little with crop in photoshop.', '2005-03-14 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227803, 155418, 33560, '<td valign="top">Normally I lke night shots, but there is something about the way the lighting works (or doesn''t) with this sculpture that makes me wonder if daylight might not have worked better.  It''s a great sculpture for this challenge, and it is photographed against an ideal foil.</td>', 'Normally I lke night shots, but there is something about the way the lighting works (or doesn''t) with this sculpture that makes me wonder if daylight might not have worked better.  It''s a great sculpture for this challenge, and it is photographed against an ideal foil.', '2005-03-14 19:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227804, 155537, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice; would have done well in Ansel Adams as well as this challenge.</td>', 'Nice; would have done well in Ansel Adams as well as this challenge.', '2005-03-14 19:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227813, 154259, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the color palette. The background is perfect fo the subject.  <br/> <br/>I wish that blue door weren''t there.  Or that the camera placement would have caused it to fill the space between uprights.  It would be the merest quibble, except that the shadow lines direct our eyes to the phone booth and when we get there, it''s cluttered up by the background.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the color palette. The background is perfect fo the subject.   I wish that blue door weren''t there.  Or that the camera placement would have caused it to fill the space between uprights.  It would be the merest quibble, except that the shadow lines direct our eyes to the phone booth and when we get there, it''s cluttered up by the background. ', '2005-03-14 19:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227815, 154306, 31606, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bothers me is the reflections.</td>', 'The only thing that bothers me is the reflections.', '2005-03-14 19:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227819, 155743, 31597, '<td valign="top">you picked a good subject, a little off center but i won''t hold it against you  ;)</td>', 'you picked a good subject, a little off center but i won''t hold it against you  ;)', '2005-03-14 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227820, 155555, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Great detail - almost looks like woven cloth - and lovely subdued colours. Not sure if the vertical placement excites enough, but the lines flowing away from the stalk do liven up the shot.</td>', 'Excellent. Great detail - almost looks like woven cloth - and lovely subdued colours. Not sure if the vertical placement excites enough, but the lines flowing away from the stalk do liven up the shot.', '2005-03-14 19:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227821, 155537, 33560, '<td valign="top">The graininess of this photo really bothers me.</td>', 'The graininess of this photo really bothers me.', '2005-03-14 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227823, 155770, 31597, '<td valign="top">I love the misty effect, neat image right?  good show</td>', 'I love the misty effect, neat image right?  good show', '2005-03-14 19:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227825, 153566, 4411, '<td valign="top">Colours are nice, but it doesn''t seem sharp enough.</td>', 'Colours are nice, but it doesn''t seem sharp enough.', '2005-03-14 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227829, 155367, 33560, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately they subject is so dark that lightening it to bring it alive has washed out the trees and the walkway of the bridge. It''s got strong lines, but the exposure may have been too difficult.</td>', 'Unfortunately they subject is so dark that lightening it to bring it alive has washed out the trees and the walkway of the bridge. It''s got strong lines, but the exposure may have been too difficult.', '2005-03-14 19:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227830, 153757, 31597, '<td valign="top">you know, this is a really interesting image.  i, however, can''t decide if i like it or really like it.  colour and focus are good as well as the subject.  but i think that it is the aspect that its ''just'' frozen ice on a tree, not something more special.  all in all, good technical aspects but not enough ''umph''. 7</td>', 'you know, this is a really interesting image.  i, however, can''t decide if i like it or really like it.  colour and focus are good as well as the subject.  but i think that it is the aspect that its ''just'' frozen ice on a tree, not something more special.  all in all, good technical aspects but not enough ''umph''. 7', '2005-03-14 19:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227833, 154715, 31597, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo.  really has nothing to do with lines, however you titled it well enough that i can score it high, 9</td>', 'i really like this photo.  really has nothing to do with lines, however you titled it well enough that i can score it high, 9', '2005-03-14 19:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227837, 155185, 31597, '<td valign="top">next time try to photograph with a higher quality setting.  the bars in this photo are a bit pixel-ish</td>', 'next time try to photograph with a higher quality setting.  the bars in this photo are a bit pixel-ish', '2005-03-14 19:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227842, 154974, 31597, '<td valign="top">this is a really cool photo because of its simplicity. i give it a 8</td>', 'this is a really cool photo because of its simplicity. i give it a 8', '2005-03-14 19:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227853, 155727, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the colors!  Wow.</td>', 'I love the colors!  Wow.', '2005-03-14 19:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227857, 155410, 31597, '<td valign="top">i get your concept for this image, and i like it.  at first i thought the image was damaged, now i see your following 3rds rule.  wish people whold get creative like you did with that rule. 8</td>', 'i get your concept for this image, and i like it.  at first i thought the image was damaged, now i see your following 3rds rule.  wish people whold get creative like you did with that rule. 8', '2005-03-14 19:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
