(1227919, 155696, 31597, '<td valign="top">somehow i think that this image is too post-edited to be truly affective.  i''m not really gonna hold it against you ''cause i know i''m guilty of the same thing.  i think that you found a good subject for this challenge and good call on making this black and white.</td>', 'somehow i think that this image is too post-edited to be truly affective.  i''m not really gonna hold it against you ''cause i know i''m guilty of the same thing.  i think that you found a good subject for this challenge and good call on making this black and white.', '2005-03-14 20:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227925, 154277, 31606, '<td valign="top">I am viewing this on my second go around.  I always blast through the voting on the first round giving the ones I like a 6 and the ones I dislike a 4.  On the first round when I saw this I thought it was a good photo and gave it a 6.  Upon second inspection I have a new favorite photo and have given you a 10.  I will be dissapointed if this doesn''t make it in the top three.  You have done an excellent job here.  I love the gothic look and the cracks in the columns and how they seem to go on forever.  Some of them seem old and some of them seem new.  You have talent and probably know that.  Keep up the good work and good luck in this and other challenges. <br/> <br/>P.S.  I better at least get a thank you for this long of a comment.</td>', 'I am viewing this on my second go around.  I always blast through the voting on the first round giving the ones I like a 6 and the ones I dislike a 4.  On the first round when I saw this I thought it was a good photo and gave it a 6.  Upon second inspection I have a new favorite photo and have given you a 10.  I will be dissapointed if this doesn''t make it in the top three.  You have done an excellent job here.  I love the gothic look and the cracks in the columns and how they seem to go on forever.  Some of them seem old and some of them seem new.  You have talent and probably know that.  Keep up the good work and good luck in this and other challenges.  P.S.  I better at least get a thank you for this long of a comment.', '2005-03-14 20:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227936, 154777, 32997, '<td valign="top">I find both the lighting and composition awkward-not sure why it is necessary to include so much of the wall.</td>', 'I find both the lighting and composition awkward-not sure why it is necessary to include so much of the wall.', '2005-03-14 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227939, 155642, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great composition-love that it maintains the worn out feel. 9</td>', 'Great composition-love that it maintains the worn out feel. 9', '2005-03-14 20:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227944, 155375, 4411, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you''ve placed the wires in the corners. A nice depth of field too to keep the detail on the pole.</td>', 'I really like the way you''ve placed the wires in the corners. A nice depth of field too to keep the detail on the pole.', '2005-03-14 20:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227950, 155545, 32997, '<td valign="top">Great concept and delivery.</td>', 'Great concept and delivery.', '2005-03-14 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227955, 154437, 32997, '<td valign="top">Haunting.</td>', 'Haunting.', '2005-03-14 20:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
