(1227963, 155754, 31597, '<td valign="top">this is a good subject however i don''t like how the color turned out.  its too dull, i think that the photo would have more life if the snow looked like a true white, which can easily be edited.</td>', 'this is a good subject however i don''t like how the color turned out.  its too dull, i think that the photo would have more life if the snow looked like a true white, which can easily be edited.', '2005-03-14 20:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227965, 155758, 32997, '<td valign="top">Excellent-nice tones!</td>', 'Excellent-nice tones!', '2005-03-14 20:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227967, 155282, 19978, '<td valign="top">Whatever this, and I can''t place it yet, it is a beautiful and pleasing image. The sheer variety of tones is a feast for the eye. I''ve spent many minutes so far studying it and I haven''t had the desire to click on to the next image. Surely an accomplishment for you and you should do well in the voting. Excellent: I can''t wait to see what it is.</td>', 'Whatever this, and I can''t place it yet, it is a beautiful and pleasing image. The sheer variety of tones is a feast for the eye. I''ve spent many minutes so far studying it and I haven''t had the desire to click on to the next image. Surely an accomplishment for you and you should do well in the voting. Excellent: I can''t wait to see what it is.', '2005-03-14 20:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227969, 154613, 19978, '<td valign="top">Of all the "blind" shots, this is my favorite so far. Your decision to place objects within the image to draw the eye was a good one. I submitted a "blind" shot to the backlight challenge and, though I liked the result a lot, I suffered in the voting due to lack of subject. I wish you had used all the pixels you had available to you. This image would have benefitted from the larger size.</td>', 'Of all the "blind" shots, this is my favorite so far. Your decision to place objects within the image to draw the eye was a good one. I submitted a "blind" shot to the backlight challenge and, though I liked the result a lot, I suffered in the voting due to lack of subject. I wish you had used all the pixels you had available to you. This image would have benefitted from the larger size.', '2005-03-14 20:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227971, 155488, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. I can''t see immediately how it was done. The crop is very effective.</td>', 'Very nice effect. I can''t see immediately how it was done. The crop is very effective.', '2005-03-14 20:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227974, 155509, 31597, '<td valign="top">hey! i have that same chair in my kichen!  this is a completely random subject that i don''t think it very effective.  however, the textures and shadows in the snow are beautiful, eventhough i know that really isn''t the subject.  maybe if the image were black and white it would be better?  or photograph the chairs shadow so its pointing one o''clock?</td>', 'hey! i have that same chair in my kichen!  this is a completely random subject that i don''t think it very effective.  however, the textures and shadows in the snow are beautiful, eventhough i know that really isn''t the subject.  maybe if the image were black and white it would be better?  or photograph the chairs shadow so its pointing one o''clock?', '2005-03-14 20:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227975, 155723, 19978, '<td valign="top">This image would have benefitted from more color saturation, making the greens really pop.</td>', 'This image would have benefitted from more color saturation, making the greens really pop.', '2005-03-14 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1227977, 155613, 19978, '<td valign="top">Love it! I would have looked for a similar image but our crops are not even close to be up here yet. Your perspective is outstanding. A wonderful image!</td>', 'Love it! I would have looked for a similar image but our crops are not even close to be up here yet. Your perspective is outstanding. A wonderful image!', '2005-03-14 20:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
