(1228439, 154963, 34192, '<td valign="top">he must have had his blinker on.  I think this is really cool.  Love the point of view.  Love the texture of the ground vs. the flatness of the sky.  good composition.  Makes me want to see where they are going.  Who cares - they''ll go where I want them to! 8. will pass again...</td>', 'he must have had his blinker on.  I think this is really cool.  Love the point of view.  Love the texture of the ground vs. the flatness of the sky.  good composition.  Makes me want to see where they are going.  Who cares - they''ll go where I want them to! 8. will pass again...', '2005-03-15 06:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228441, 155255, 34192, '<td valign="top">pretty, like the composition, like the colors, fits the clhallenge.  Only thing missing is impact.  Better (less static) than most flower shots but it doesn''t evoke a response more than pretty. 7 but will pass again.</td>', 'pretty, like the composition, like the colors, fits the clhallenge.  Only thing missing is impact.  Better (less static) than most flower shots but it doesn''t evoke a response more than pretty. 7 but will pass again.', '2005-03-15 06:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228442, 154863, 34192, '<td valign="top">too many!  I''d hate to live there.  The focus is sharp but there is no focus for the viewer.  I have no place to ''rest my eyes.'' Its fits the challenge but doesn''t really go much beyond that.  I have no sense of the photographer or why he would take the picture.  No emotional impact.  No investment.</td>', 'too many!  I''d hate to live there.  The focus is sharp but there is no focus for the viewer.  I have no place to ''rest my eyes.'' Its fits the challenge but doesn''t really go much beyond that.  I have no sense of the photographer or why he would take the picture.  No emotional impact.  No investment.', '2005-03-15 06:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
