(1228543, 155209, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 <br/>Technical: 2 A tripod I think would have slowed the the slight motion. <br/>Compostion: 2 I would have tried to get the horizontal line by the trees perpendicular to the lines created from the crop fields. I have also tried to keep the closer barn within the frame of the picture. The idea is to keep the eye within the picture and not let it stray around.<br/>Appeal: 3 I lost the wow factor due to the blurness.<br/>Overall: 4</td>', 'Challenge: 10 Technical: 2 A tripod I think would have slowed the the slight motion. Compostion: 2 I would have tried to get the horizontal line by the trees perpendicular to the lines created from the crop fields. I have also tried to keep the closer barn within the frame of the picture. The idea is to keep the eye within the picture and not let it stray around.Appeal: 3 I lost the wow factor due to the blurness.Overall: 4', '2005-03-15 07:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228549, 155686, 34058, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Very nice picture!</td>', 'Love it!  Very nice picture!', '2005-03-15 07:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
