(1228569, 154164, 27605, '<td valign="top">Original idea for the challenge, but the title leaves me scratching my head!  ...6...  (Post-script):  After a bit of reading and pondering, I finally figured it out, ha.</td>', 'Original idea for the challenge, but the title leaves me scratching my head!  ...6...  (Post-script):  After a bit of reading and pondering, I finally figured it out, ha.', '2005-03-15 08:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
