(1228581, 154655, 33629, '<td valign="top">love this but would like to see some little point of interest</td>', 'love this but would like to see some little point of interest', '2005-03-15 08:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228585, 153903, 33629, '<td valign="top">love the colors mucho</td>', 'love the colors mucho', '2005-03-15 08:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228588, 155484, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I like the position of the plane relative to the whole frame. But I also am wondering how it would have looked if it was taken a few seconds before. The position of the plane may turn to be less attractive in relation to the main frame, but it could look better in relation to the curves. Don''t think I am succeeding in putting down what I really want to say :) I am just imagining this shot in different ways. <br/> Bottom line is, I think it''s a wonderful capture and I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very cool. I like the position of the plane relative to the whole frame. But I also am wondering how it would have looked if it was taken a few seconds before. The position of the plane may turn to be less attractive in relation to the main frame, but it could look better in relation to the curves. Don''t think I am succeeding in putting down what I really want to say :) I am just imagining this shot in different ways.  Bottom line is, I think it''s a wonderful capture and I like it a lot.', '2005-03-15 08:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228591, 154572, 33629, '<td valign="top">i really love this but would have removed the specs on the left backgroudn</td>', 'i really love this but would have removed the specs on the left backgroudn', '2005-03-15 08:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
