(1228606, 155613, 19959, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-03-15 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228608, 155209, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very sorry, but this has very little going for it. It''s out of focus, lacks a focal point of interest and is way over exposed. If you have the ability with your camera I would lower your f-stop to about f6-8, focus around 2/3 of the way across the field and try getting low down to include some corn in the foreground or something to alter the bland point of view. This would give the viewer the sense of being involved in the photo rather than simply presented with a scene that one is familiar with from a car window.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.<br/>Jon</td>', 'Very sorry, but this has very little going for it. It''s out of focus, lacks a focal point of interest and is way over exposed. If you have the ability with your camera I would lower your f-stop to about f6-8, focus around 2/3 of the way across the field and try getting low down to include some corn in the foreground or something to alter the bland point of view. This would give the viewer the sense of being involved in the photo rather than simply presented with a scene that one is familiar with from a car window. Hope this helps.Jon', '2005-03-15 08:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
