(1228649, 155476, 24511, '<td valign="top">Ice crack lines...how interesting.   You could have removed the busy background to accentuate the lines.  I love the colorful orange ovals that brighten up the scene and contrast with the dark colorless strands of black ice cracks.  Thanks. 5</td>', 'Ice crack lines...how interesting.   You could have removed the busy background to accentuate the lines.  I love the colorful orange ovals that brighten up the scene and contrast with the dark colorless strands of black ice cracks.  Thanks. 5', '2005-03-15 09:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
