(1228677, 155461, 24511, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait and good idea to have age lines as a theme.  Only wrinkle for me is that I feel a connection with the person, the colorful neck and earings, the expression, the lovely silver earlobe ovals and very little attraction toward the facial lines.  Thanks for sharing.  My favorite 5</td>', 'Fantastic portrait and good idea to have age lines as a theme.  Only wrinkle for me is that I feel a connection with the person, the colorful neck and earings, the expression, the lovely silver earlobe ovals and very little attraction toward the facial lines.  Thanks for sharing.  My favorite 5', '2005-03-15 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228679, 155692, 27605, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photo, meets the challenge well.  A result of your LIGHT on WHITE efforts?  ....8....</td>', 'Very beautiful photo, meets the challenge well.  A result of your LIGHT on WHITE efforts?  ....8....', '2005-03-15 09:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
