(1228857, 155775, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity here, and exposure seems just right, even with my Mac monitor (which is a bit lighter). I like the composition, though some would like a stronger point of interest to be somewhere. To me, it''s nature and natural, but it retains balance. My eye tends to end up on the far left cactus since it is the most interesting of the several presented. 8</td>', 'Nice clarity here, and exposure seems just right, even with my Mac monitor (which is a bit lighter). I like the composition, though some would like a stronger point of interest to be somewhere. To me, it''s nature and natural, but it retains balance. My eye tends to end up on the far left cactus since it is the most interesting of the several presented. 8', '2005-03-15 10:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
