(1228863, 155765, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and taken during the right time of day for nice shadows. I want everything to be level, but it appears the danged structure itself is not level. :)</td>', 'Nice perspective and taken during the right time of day for nice shadows. I want everything to be level, but it appears the danged structure itself is not level. :)', '2005-03-15 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228865, 155176, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors! --though a bit blotchy. You might try shooting at a lower ISO to avoid this, even if your photo ends up being initially too dark. When you lighten it, it will be less blotchy. You can also select each color (with a nice feather to the selection) and do some various blurs (gaussian or motion) to eliminate the blotches. Finally, you can also try selecting each color, take a 5 px by 5 px color sample, and actually paint the color on with, perhaps, a 50% opacity to the brush--OR you can even use the fill tool at a certain percept opacity. Nice composition and an interesting abstract. Good luck! 6</td>', 'Lovely colors! --though a bit blotchy. You might try shooting at a lower ISO to avoid this, even if your photo ends up being initially too dark. When you lighten it, it will be less blotchy. You can also select each color (with a nice feather to the selection) and do some various blurs (gaussian or motion) to eliminate the blotches. Finally, you can also try selecting each color, take a 5 px by 5 px color sample, and actually paint the color on with, perhaps, a 50% opacity to the brush--OR you can even use the fill tool at a certain percept opacity. Nice composition and an interesting abstract. Good luck! 6', '2005-03-15 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1228867, 155766, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great texture. Unsure if the grass at the bottom adds to the composition or not. Like your choice for this challenge.</td>', 'Great texture. Unsure if the grass at the bottom adds to the composition or not. Like your choice for this challenge.', '2005-03-15 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
