(1229041, 155410, 5792, '<td valign="top">Normally I would not like the stark white ground in the foreground, but it works very well in this composition. I''m sure there will be varied opinions about that. This iimages perfectly conveys to me the feeling that it is snowing outside. (And I''m down in sunny Arizona! :) )</td>', 'Normally I would not like the stark white ground in the foreground, but it works very well in this composition. I''m sure there will be varied opinions about that. This iimages perfectly conveys to me the feeling that it is snowing outside. (And I''m down in sunny Arizona! :) )', '2005-03-15 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
