(1229130, 155569, 33435, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure what you were going for here.  It looks like the person (you? self -portrait? or model) is stretching naked against a railing, or perhaps having a heart to heart talk with the foot.  When I''m voting on a picture, natural poses capture my attention, or an interesting pose.  This doesn''t appear natural at all.  I certainly don''t take off all my clothes and stretch out on my railing, so I can''t even relate to what was captured.  What''s going on here doesn''t seem interesting.  The lighting could have been better.  Also, when doing nudes, or having a person close up in the photo, it is much more interesting to see the person from the front, at least the face.  Its hard to pull off a photo of a person with their back turned.</td>', 'I''m really not sure what you were going for here.  It looks like the person (you? self -portrait? or model) is stretching naked against a railing, or perhaps having a heart to heart talk with the foot.  When I''m voting on a picture, natural poses capture my attention, or an interesting pose.  This doesn''t appear natural at all.  I certainly don''t take off all my clothes and stretch out on my railing, so I can''t even relate to what was captured.  What''s going on here doesn''t seem interesting.  The lighting could have been better.  Also, when doing nudes, or having a person close up in the photo, it is much more interesting to see the person from the front, at least the face.  Its hard to pull off a photo of a person with their back turned.', '2005-03-15 12:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229134, 153566, 31541, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The focus seems a little soft.', '2005-03-15 12:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
