(1229140, 153757, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but overall a bit too random. Focusing on a smaller area may have produced a stronger image.</td>', 'Nice colours but overall a bit too random. Focusing on a smaller area may have produced a stronger image.', '2005-03-15 12:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229142, 155356, 31541, '<td valign="top">The bottom of the pic (with the people) is a little distracting - perhaps cropping just below "cinemas" line would help?</td>', 'The bottom of the pic (with the people) is a little distracting - perhaps cropping just below "cinemas" line would help?', '2005-03-15 12:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229146, 155619, 33435, '<td valign="top">Alright, I have a pretty good idea who this is submitting this photo.  I''m not sure what your deal is dude, but you have been submitting photos for quite a few challenges.  You have to at least be picking up better technique as you go.  Use it.  Your photos seem like you are doing this to be funny.  In the event that you are seriously giving this an effort, your angle for the shot is ok.  With the lighting and time of day, you could have used the light to your advantage.  This just looks like a snapshot.  The background is way too distracting, and even with a low cost camera, there should be manual settings as to where you can keep the front line in focus and have the background just be blurred.  Also, you can do a better job with your pixelation.  This image is way too noisy.  Shoot with a higher resolution.  Again, if this is who I think it is, you obviously care enough to submit photos, put a better effort into it.  It isn''t hard to become a good photographer.</td>', 'Alright, I have a pretty good idea who this is submitting this photo.  I''m not sure what your deal is dude, but you have been submitting photos for quite a few challenges.  You have to at least be picking up better technique as you go.  Use it.  Your photos seem like you are doing this to be funny.  In the event that you are seriously giving this an effort, your angle for the shot is ok.  With the lighting and time of day, you could have used the light to your advantage.  This just looks like a snapshot.  The background is way too distracting, and even with a low cost camera, there should be manual settings as to where you can keep the front line in focus and have the background just be blurred.  Also, you can do a better job with your pixelation.  This image is way too noisy.  Shoot with a higher resolution.  Again, if this is who I think it is, you obviously care enough to submit photos, put a better effort into it.  It isn''t hard to become a good photographer.', '2005-03-15 12:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229150, 154960, 31541, '<td valign="top">The bar on the top is very distracting.  The red lines are a good subject though!</td>', 'The bar on the top is very distracting.  The red lines are a good subject though!', '2005-03-15 12:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229154, 154655, 33435, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the bottom up a little higher and had that cornerin the lower right be symmetrical with the top left. Maybe I''m being too picky, but I think it would have made a big difference in this photo. 7</td>', 'I would have cropped the bottom up a little higher and had that cornerin the lower right be symmetrical with the top left. Maybe I''m being too picky, but I think it would have made a big difference in this photo. 7', '2005-03-15 12:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229156, 155675, 31541, '<td valign="top">The black bar across the photo is distracting.  Was there a way to take the pic without it?</td>', 'The black bar across the photo is distracting.  Was there a way to take the pic without it?', '2005-03-15 13:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229161, 155710, 33435, '<td valign="top">neat photo 10</td>', 'neat photo 10', '2005-03-15 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
