(1229269, 155665, 8139, '<td valign="top">Very nice :)</td>', 'Very nice :)', '2005-03-15 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229283, 155509, 24511, '<td valign="top">Love the title.  Lower right lines fantastic.  Croping your lines in the corner hints towards me viewing away from the photo instead of pulling me in.  Contrast wonderful between chair &amp; shadow against the snow.  Thanks 5</td>', 'Love the title.  Lower right lines fantastic.  Croping your lines in the corner hints towards me viewing away from the photo instead of pulling me in.  Contrast wonderful between chair & shadow against the snow.  Thanks 5', '2005-03-15 13:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229291, 154893, 8139, '<td valign="top">Interesting...Nice dynamic and colors.</td>', 'Interesting...Nice dynamic and colors.', '2005-03-15 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229318, 154631, 33435, '<td valign="top">Beautiful angle.  I hope this gets a ribbon. 10</td>', 'Beautiful angle.  I hope this gets a ribbon. 10', '2005-03-15 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229345, 154947, 33435, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if there was a little more contrast.  Beautiful shot 8</td>', 'I would have liked this better if there was a little more contrast.  Beautiful shot 8', '2005-03-15 13:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229364, 155185, 33435, '<td valign="top">You could have done a much better job with the lighting in this photo.  It looks like you just grabbed a snapshot with a short exposure and a bright flash, then cropped it to look nicer.  The flash ruined this.  The bars are way too peaky in the center, and then have a distracting shadow on the back wall.  The right lighting can really add to the mood of the photo, and the wrong lighting can ruin it completely.</td>', 'You could have done a much better job with the lighting in this photo.  It looks like you just grabbed a snapshot with a short exposure and a bright flash, then cropped it to look nicer.  The flash ruined this.  The bars are way too peaky in the center, and then have a distracting shadow on the back wall.  The right lighting can really add to the mood of the photo, and the wrong lighting can ruin it completely.', '2005-03-15 13:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229370, 155564, 24511, '<td valign="top">One path equals one line split down the middle.  I''m curious about the true color of the field vegetation.  When I see black and white photos, I yearn for shadings from very light to darkest of darks to avoid hum drum grey wash.  Individuals help punch some dark shade into the picture.  After an Ansel Adams challenge I should try some black and white photos too.  Of course he had more than a week unlike us dpchallengers.  Good luck.</td>', 'One path equals one line split down the middle.  I''m curious about the true color of the field vegetation.  When I see black and white photos, I yearn for shadings from very light to darkest of darks to avoid hum drum grey wash.  Individuals help punch some dark shade into the picture.  After an Ansel Adams challenge I should try some black and white photos too.  Of course he had more than a week unlike us dpchallengers.  Good luck.', '2005-03-15 13:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229371, 155563, 33435, '<td valign="top">This would be better without that damned tree in the way.</td>', 'This would be better without that damned tree in the way.', '2005-03-15 13:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229384, 154860, 33435, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but what did she die from?  The coke is still layed out on the table.</td>', 'Interesting, but what did she die from?  The coke is still layed out on the table.', '2005-03-15 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229387, 154863, 24511, '<td valign="top">My previous vote had one path as a line unlike your explosion of wires.  Very theme worthy.  Little color and lower landscape a let down. Good luck.</td>', 'My previous vote had one path as a line unlike your explosion of wires.  Very theme worthy.  Little color and lower landscape a let down. Good luck.', '2005-03-15 13:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
