(1229420, 155533, 24511, '<td valign="top">Very wavy lines.  Lower left dark vs upper right light beautiful.  I prefer color despite Ansel Adams wanabes like myself.  Hey, if you can produce nice black and whites maybe I can too.  Thanks 5</td>', 'Very wavy lines.  Lower left dark vs upper right light beautiful.  I prefer color despite Ansel Adams wanabes like myself.  Hey, if you can produce nice black and whites maybe I can too.  Thanks 5', '2005-03-15 13:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229423, 154862, 24511, '<td valign="top">OK...how did you do this?  Surely our Nikon 3100 doesn''t have the houfsba to create such special effects.  Was it done on camera or on computer?  Curious.  Good luck 6</td>', 'OK...how did you do this?  Surely our Nikon 3100 doesn''t have the houfsba to create such special effects.  Was it done on camera or on computer?  Curious.  Good luck 6', '2005-03-15 13:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229426, 155129, 28299, '<td valign="top">clear and crisp!</td>', 'clear and crisp!', '2005-03-15 13:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229429, 155399, 24511, '<td valign="top">This is my first sepia photo vote on this site.  Lovely lined logs with mini blades of grass to strenthen the theme.  Bravo.  Interesting composition.  Despite my love of color giving you a high 8.  Thanks.</td>', 'This is my first sepia photo vote on this site.  Lovely lined logs with mini blades of grass to strenthen the theme.  Bravo.  Interesting composition.  Despite my love of color giving you a high 8.  Thanks.', '2005-03-15 13:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229437, 155482, 24511, '<td valign="top">Not enough line theme but cat portrait winner.  Is the right cheek out of focus?  Wiskers are the best lines of all but hard to notice.  My cat friends will hate me but the competition is tough this challenge.  Good luck 3</td>', 'Not enough line theme but cat portrait winner.  Is the right cheek out of focus?  Wiskers are the best lines of all but hard to notice.  My cat friends will hate me but the competition is tough this challenge.  Good luck 3', '2005-03-15 13:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229442, 154807, 24511, '<td valign="top">I see the line but am left hungry to see the harley''s close-up.  Serious expressions on bikers unfortunate.  Very busy.  Good newspaper headline photo.  Thanks 4.</td>', 'I see the line but am left hungry to see the harley''s close-up.  Serious expressions on bikers unfortunate.  Very busy.  Good newspaper headline photo.  Thanks 4.', '2005-03-15 13:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229450, 155337, 24511, '<td valign="top">Focus is on the spider and less on the web linings.  Blue color at the back enhance the interest of the viewer.  National Geographic look out.  Thanks.</td>', 'Focus is on the spider and less on the web linings.  Blue color at the back enhance the interest of the viewer.  National Geographic look out.  Thanks.', '2005-03-15 13:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229460, 155674, 24511, '<td valign="top">Neon line looking great photo.  Good use of space.  Love the rebel cord at the bottom leaving the others for a different direction.  Break the mold photo getting high score of 8.  Thanks.</td>', 'Neon line looking great photo.  Good use of space.  Love the rebel cord at the bottom leaving the others for a different direction.  Break the mold photo getting high score of 8.  Thanks.', '2005-03-15 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229467, 154613, 24511, '<td valign="top">Small size photo.  Green leafs add wonderful color contrast to whites and greys.  Blinds just shout out loud lines as a theme.  Thanks. 5</td>', 'Small size photo.  Green leafs add wonderful color contrast to whites and greys.  Blinds just shout out loud lines as a theme.  Thanks. 5', '2005-03-15 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229477, 155412, 24511, '<td valign="top">This is my fifth pole this challenge.  Very popular subject.  Angle interesting.  Post has great lines headed toward top.  Wires also direct path to same focal point.  Jumble of leafless branches extremely line-able.  At first I was bored but at second glance, it is by far my favorite electric pole.  Raising score to a 7.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is my fifth pole this challenge.  Very popular subject.  Angle interesting.  Post has great lines headed toward top.  Wires also direct path to same focal point.  Jumble of leafless branches extremely line-able.  At first I was bored but at second glance, it is by far my favorite electric pole.  Raising score to a 7.  Good luck.', '2005-03-15 14:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229479, 155396, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  The colors are a little washed but the DOF is great. I want to know where the trail leads...7</td>', 'I like this picture.  The colors are a little washed but the DOF is great. I want to know where the trail leads...7', '2005-03-15 14:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
