(1229493, 155557, 24511, '<td valign="top">Again live wires...light and shadow exellent.  I would like to see this photo in black and white.  Was this using sepia?  Good luck</td>', 'Again live wires...light and shadow exellent.  I would like to see this photo in black and white.  Was this using sepia?  Good luck', '2005-03-15 14:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
