(1229497, 155758, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this image.  It looks painted.  Very simple, straight forward shot.  Good DOF, focus,  POV works for me. 8</td>', 'I love the colors in this image.  It looks painted.  Very simple, straight forward shot.  Good DOF, focus,  POV works for me. 8', '2005-03-15 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
