(1229974, 155451, 16912, '<td valign="top">My last vote of the challenge :)  I always look at titles and think they are important but they don''t sway my final vote. I''ve seen a lot of clever/witty titles in this challenge, glad I saved the best till last :)<br/>As for the picture I think the main? bokeh is a little too bright but love the flow/curves in the plant. A bit more detail in the centre would have helped this shot score an extra point. I also like the way the plant is leaning from the dark background toward the light.</td>', 'My last vote of the challenge :)  I always look at titles and think they are important but they don''t sway my final vote. I''ve seen a lot of clever/witty titles in this challenge, glad I saved the best till last :)As for the picture I think the main? bokeh is a little too bright but love the flow/curves in the plant. A bit more detail in the centre would have helped this shot score an extra point. I also like the way the plant is leaning from the dark background toward the light.', '2005-03-15 17:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1229976, 154311, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I like the shape and orientation of the red square. The rest of the composition disappoints. Would be better with a bit more light on the subject or possibly a couple of lights from different directions as these would bring out some interesting shadows. Possibly violates terms of use.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I like the shape and orientation of the red square. The rest of the composition disappoints. Would be better with a bit more light on the subject or possibly a couple of lights from different directions as these would bring out some interesting shadows. Possibly violates terms of use.', '2005-03-15 17:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
