(1230362, 155026, 19978, '<td valign="top">A good example of when a little oversharpening is a good thing. The subtle halo around the figure is very powerful. It looks biblical. Nice touch!</td>', 'A good example of when a little oversharpening is a good thing. The subtle halo around the figure is very powerful. It looks biblical. Nice touch!', '2005-03-15 20:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
