(1230646, 155545, 34069, '<td valign="top">Neat.  You might try making the skyline completely black, so it''s just a silhouette.  Still, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Neat.  You might try making the skyline completely black, so it''s just a silhouette.  Still, one of my favorites.', '2005-03-15 23:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
