(1230651, 155520, 34069, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The curvaceous body is a good counterpoint to all of the straight lines.  One of  my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent.  The curvaceous body is a good counterpoint to all of the straight lines.  One of  my favorites this challenge.', '2005-03-15 23:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
