(1232210, 155400, 2490, '<td valign="top">For some reason the gray "background" doesn''t seem to match.  Is it really the sky?  Good art, but it leaves my neck sore :) 7</td>', 'For some reason the gray "background" doesn''t seem to match.  Is it really the sky?  Good art, but it leaves my neck sore :) 7', '2005-03-16 12:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232212, 154965, 2490, '<td valign="top">Somehow the poles seem too dominant, but this is a good perspective shot. 6</td>', 'Somehow the poles seem too dominant, but this is a good perspective shot. 6', '2005-03-16 12:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232217, 155670, 2490, '<td valign="top">If the wood was "yellow" I would have used more of the red channel in my conversion to try to make the wood brighter and the sky darker.  You''ve got excellent depth of field and good dark shadows, but the wood just doesn''t stand out as much as it could.  The "grays" feel "monotonous" rather than deep and dynamic.  Love the composition. 7</td>', 'If the wood was "yellow" I would have used more of the red channel in my conversion to try to make the wood brighter and the sky darker.  You''ve got excellent depth of field and good dark shadows, but the wood just doesn''t stand out as much as it could.  The "grays" feel "monotonous" rather than deep and dynamic.  Love the composition. 7', '2005-03-16 12:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232222, 154948, 2490, '<td valign="top">Ummm, didja miss the Ansel challenge? :)  This is a great shot, just a little soft in the foreground.  I''ll give you credit on the "skyline" theme :) 8</td>', 'Ummm, didja miss the Ansel challenge? :)  This is a great shot, just a little soft in the foreground.  I''ll give you credit on the "skyline" theme :) 8', '2005-03-16 13:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232225, 154860, 9780, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-03-16 13:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232226, 155590, 2490, '<td valign="top">Turn down the greens and crop just a little more to the right.  Let the fence "fill the frame" and thus dominate the shot.  The trees and weeds just interfere without adding.  5</td>', 'Turn down the greens and crop just a little more to the right.  Let the fence "fill the frame" and thus dominate the shot.  The trees and weeds just interfere without adding.  5', '2005-03-16 13:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
