(1232293, 155026, 31133, '<td valign="top">They certainly are graceful lines. Nice shot, nice compostion.</td>', 'They certainly are graceful lines. Nice shot, nice compostion.', '2005-03-16 13:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232297, 155265, 31133, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge and is well-composed. I don''t think the bridge cables needed to be red - it''s the only thing that detracts from this photo for me.</td>', 'This meets the challenge and is well-composed. I don''t think the bridge cables needed to be red - it''s the only thing that detracts from this photo for me.', '2005-03-16 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232299, 155599, 31133, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good colors and depth.</td>', 'Very nice. Good colors and depth.', '2005-03-16 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232308, 154753, 6999, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach - really interesting. A shame that the distortion of the screen causes that bending of the images, and that you couldn''t quite be rid of the scanning lines of the screen. Those two elements take away from the magical impact of the shot somewhat. But I like the effect, very much.</td>', 'An interesting approach - really interesting. A shame that the distortion of the screen causes that bending of the images, and that you couldn''t quite be rid of the scanning lines of the screen. Those two elements take away from the magical impact of the shot somewhat. But I like the effect, very much.', '2005-03-16 13:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232310, 155527, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a beatiful image. The lines of the rain in the background are especially moving.</td>', 'What a beatiful image. The lines of the rain in the background are especially moving.', '2005-03-16 13:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232315, 154657, 6999, '<td valign="top">The immediate reaction is that this could do without the stem to the right, and the lower part of its own stem, but then you''d be moving into stock photography world, and we''d all be crying out for different lighting. After some consideration of this, I think that to really emphasise the lines more contrast is needed - their translucency doesn''t help with a sense of texture, a sense of really being able to touch the thing.</td>', 'The immediate reaction is that this could do without the stem to the right, and the lower part of its own stem, but then you''d be moving into stock photography world, and we''d all be crying out for different lighting. After some consideration of this, I think that to really emphasise the lines more contrast is needed - their translucency doesn''t help with a sense of texture, a sense of really being able to touch the thing.', '2005-03-16 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232317, 154319, 31133, '<td valign="top">This one made me smile, not just because of the hope in the title - it''s a fantastic image. It might be nice without the grain in the sky, but it also looks like you might have wanted it there.</td>', 'This one made me smile, not just because of the hope in the title - it''s a fantastic image. It might be nice without the grain in the sky, but it also looks like you might have wanted it there.', '2005-03-16 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232324, 155176, 6999, '<td valign="top">A great shae that you couldn''t do anything about the very blotchy noise in the upper part of frame. There is a sense of grace here, but mostly for me it falls too much into the area of the abstract, and not particularly striking with it. The tones are fine though - well represented. One point - the tiny little bit of skyline(?) showing bottom right could surely have been dealt with.</td>', 'A great shae that you couldn''t do anything about the very blotchy noise in the upper part of frame. There is a sense of grace here, but mostly for me it falls too much into the area of the abstract, and not particularly striking with it. The tones are fine though - well represented. One point - the tiny little bit of skyline(?) showing bottom right could surely have been dealt with.', '2005-03-16 13:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232325, 155461, 20018, '<td valign="top">looks a bit oversharpened and/or ps''ed, good subject though</td>', 'looks a bit oversharpened and/or ps''ed, good subject though', '2005-03-16 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232327, 155570, 6999, '<td valign="top">A strange optical crisis - I bet those inclined to epilepsy really get a buzz out of this! It almost does that thing of seming to move in the areas where you''re not looking. Good clean work, well presented, but for me lackig in any great involvement.</td>', 'A strange optical crisis - I bet those inclined to epilepsy really get a buzz out of this! It almost does that thing of seming to move in the areas where you''re not looking. Good clean work, well presented, but for me lackig in any great involvement.', '2005-03-16 13:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232341, 154164, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fun :-) Is it a bit over-compressed? The artefacts from that don''t do you any favours, making it harder to read. Perhaps destaturating some of the colour might have helped keep the file size down, and making things more readable. Excellent idea though, and looks pretty well shot through the compression artefacts.</td>', 'Fun :-) Is it a bit over-compressed? The artefacts from that don''t do you any favours, making it harder to read. Perhaps destaturating some of the colour might have helped keep the file size down, and making things more readable. Excellent idea though, and looks pretty well shot through the compression artefacts.', '2005-03-16 13:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232348, 155730, 2490, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''s narrow DOF! 6</td>', 'Now THAT''s narrow DOF! 6', '2005-03-16 13:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
