(1232417, 155738, 32767, '<td valign="top">Would have been more dramatic with a $100 bill. Kidding...nice shot.</td>', 'Would have been more dramatic with a $100 bill. Kidding...nice shot.', '2005-03-16 14:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232428, 155720, 2490, '<td valign="top">This has a really cool infrared surreal look. 8</td>', 'This has a really cool infrared surreal look. 8', '2005-03-16 14:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232429, 155184, 32767, '<td valign="top">The coloring seems off??? maybe too much yellow and red/orange.</td>', 'The coloring seems off??? maybe too much yellow and red/orange.', '2005-03-16 14:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232435, 155502, 32767, '<td valign="top">IMHO, when your depth of field is narrow you have to have things well blurred, sometimes or not at all. The points in the back need to be more out, because at this half way point, so close to the eye, they spin your head a bit.<br/> <br/>In other words, my eye is still trying to bring them into focus which of course will never happen.</td>', 'IMHO, when your depth of field is narrow you have to have things well blurred, sometimes or not at all. The points in the back need to be more out, because at this half way point, so close to the eye, they spin your head a bit. In other words, my eye is still trying to bring them into focus which of course will never happen.', '2005-03-16 14:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232436, 155488, 31443, '<td valign="top">Different and finally something interesting</td>', 'Different and finally something interesting', '2005-03-16 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232439, 155618, 2490, '<td valign="top">Hope you weren''t really this close... 7</td>', 'Hope you weren''t really this close... 7', '2005-03-16 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1232440, 155099, 2490, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''s a sharp macro. 8</td>', 'Now THAT''s a sharp macro. 8', '2005-03-16 14:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
