(1233089, 154504, 8860, '<td valign="top">This has a great vibe to it. Like the lighting, the funky 70s wallpaper and her hair - not to mention the nicely packed vest top! <br/>; )<br/> <br/>Colours are excellent and it''s just got a neat feel that I like muchly. I have to admit that I really don''t like the title though.</td>', 'This has a great vibe to it. Like the lighting, the funky 70s wallpaper and her hair - not to mention the nicely packed vest top! ; ) Colours are excellent and it''s just got a neat feel that I like muchly. I have to admit that I really don''t like the title though.', '2005-03-16 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233091, 155568, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yup - this is deliciously satisfying in its simplicity and regualrity. Nice mellow lighting - just right.</td>', 'Yup - this is deliciously satisfying in its simplicity and regualrity. Nice mellow lighting - just right.', '2005-03-16 19:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
