(1233881, 155312, 32872, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail and wonderful color.  I love elephants with a passion...your photo captures the tenderness they are known for.  Plus, the detail is so perfect!</td>', 'Incredible detail and wonderful color.  I love elephants with a passion...your photo captures the tenderness they are known for.  Plus, the detail is so perfect!', '2005-03-17 04:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233899, 155676, 6999, '<td valign="top">Solidly done image - I suspect, exactly what you were after, pretty much. It doesn''t do much for me, however: the soft focus/hyper-smooth treatment implies  a glamour and indulgence that doesn''t sit well with kids looking quite so sure of themselves.</td>', 'Solidly done image - I suspect, exactly what you were after, pretty much. It doesn''t do much for me, however: the soft focus/hyper-smooth treatment implies  a glamour and indulgence that doesn''t sit well with kids looking quite so sure of themselves.', '2005-03-17 05:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233903, 155710, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, and carefully photographed. Lines, for sure, but it lacks a certain inspiration, perhaps. I find the border a bit blocky, too - that black key-line especially.</td>', 'Nicely lit, and carefully photographed. Lines, for sure, but it lacks a certain inspiration, perhaps. I find the border a bit blocky, too - that black key-line especially.', '2005-03-17 05:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233905, 154443, 6999, '<td valign="top">Somehow, that rather heavy vignetting makes this seem as if it muxt be venetian blinds - it''s rare sunlight surely that focusses itself so carefully? it''s effective, graphically, however. I get a sense of missing detail, there isn''t that sensation of real close here- processing perhaps?</td>', 'Somehow, that rather heavy vignetting makes this seem as if it muxt be venetian blinds - it''s rare sunlight surely that focusses itself so carefully? it''s effective, graphically, however. I get a sense of missing detail, there isn''t that sensation of real close here- processing perhaps?', '2005-03-17 05:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233906, 155537, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant grain here - especially effective, rather surprisingly, on the steel (?) of the arch. I like the strong ''antique'' feel, like a documentary shot from the 50''s, poorly cared-for, when this architecture was ground-breaking.</td>', 'Very pleasant grain here - especially effective, rather surprisingly, on the steel (?) of the arch. I like the strong ''antique'' feel, like a documentary shot from the 50''s, poorly cared-for, when this architecture was ground-breaking.', '2005-03-17 05:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233909, 154854, 6999, '<td valign="top">A very blunt composition. The sky colour is pretty dull, especially in such a graphical image - a touch of darkening, or underexposure, would deepen that colour quite efffectively.</td>', 'A very blunt composition. The sky colour is pretty dull, especially in such a graphical image - a touch of darkening, or underexposure, would deepen that colour quite efffectively.', '2005-03-17 05:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233913, 155758, 23478, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what the object is, but I like this photo... it could be a bit lighter.</td>', 'I am not sure what the object is, but I like this photo... it could be a bit lighter.', '2005-03-17 05:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233915, 155676, 31443, '<td valign="top">The blur effect wasn''t needed, cute pose even thought I don''t like children to use make-up</td>', 'The blur effect wasn''t needed, cute pose even thought I don''t like children to use make-up', '2005-03-17 05:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233919, 155763, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle... the color of the train works well here with the desert backdrop.</td>', 'Interesting angle... the color of the train works well here with the desert backdrop.', '2005-03-17 05:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233921, 153861, 31443, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus could have helped and either more of the image or much less, imo ofcourse</td>', 'Sharper focus could have helped and either more of the image or much less, imo ofcourse', '2005-03-17 05:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233922, 154460, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2005-03-17 05:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
