(1233951, 155686, 31443, '<td valign="top">Those have witnessed a lot, I like this theme a lot...you could have improved on dof with a slight bigger aperture number</td>', 'Those have witnessed a lot, I like this theme a lot...you could have improved on dof with a slight bigger aperture number', '2005-03-17 05:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233953, 155144, 3087, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it a beautiful building? I have a vaguely similar shot in my challenge entries portfolio from way back - soooo photogenic isn''t it? Did you go inside the library to get a good look at the ceiling from in there? Cool eh? <br/>PS The exposure seems a little out. It might be worth adjusting levels to bring the details of the stone building out more?</td>', 'Isn''t it a beautiful building? I have a vaguely similar shot in my challenge entries portfolio from way back - soooo photogenic isn''t it? Did you go inside the library to get a good look at the ceiling from in there? Cool eh? PS The exposure seems a little out. It might be worth adjusting levels to bring the details of the stone building out more?', '2005-03-17 05:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233956, 155226, 23478, '<td valign="top">The curving lines of the bridges is interesting and the lamp post actually distracts:)  Nice shot.</td>', 'The curving lines of the bridges is interesting and the lamp post actually distracts:)  Nice shot.', '2005-03-17 05:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
