(1233978, 155579, 25355, '<td valign="top">would have been better in colour</td>', 'would have been better in colour', '2005-03-17 06:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1233983, 155159, 25355, '<td valign="top">People are actually using those things now? The Segway was big news when it was announced but I didn''t know it was being mass-produced. It looks like fun, but in the long run, I''d rather walk.</td>', 'People are actually using those things now? The Segway was big news when it was announced but I didn''t know it was being mass-produced. It looks like fun, but in the long run, I''d rather walk.', '2005-03-17 06:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
