(1234579, 155669, 30760, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a visually pleasing image, but the center composition and the lack of interesting things in the subject makes it appeal a little less to me. Maybe including more of the flower and add some more depth would do. Anyhow, I like it.</td>', 'To me, this is a visually pleasing image, but the center composition and the lack of interesting things in the subject makes it appeal a little less to me. Maybe including more of the flower and add some more depth would do. Anyhow, I like it.', '2005-03-17 13:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234581, 153566, 30760, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, however musical instruments have become a cliche at DPC to me. It needs to be executed well to work, and while it is a good enough composition and idea, the image quality is low. Also, I''d try to get closer to the lines, to make them more of a central thing. Remember, simplicity is often better, and a grand piano has a lot of strings :)</td>', 'Interesting subject, however musical instruments have become a cliche at DPC to me. It needs to be executed well to work, and while it is a good enough composition and idea, the image quality is low. Also, I''d try to get closer to the lines, to make them more of a central thing. Remember, simplicity is often better, and a grand piano has a lot of strings :)', '2005-03-17 13:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234583, 155486, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The vanishing point composition and selective desaturation works very well. The rest of the image isn''t extremely interesting, and the trees/skies would be better with more contrast and perhaps spot work. <br/> <br/>Then again, the challenge is "Lines", and you''ve captured the lines and made them a central part of the image. So it might just be the right thing :)</td>', 'Nicely done. The vanishing point composition and selective desaturation works very well. The rest of the image isn''t extremely interesting, and the trees/skies would be better with more contrast and perhaps spot work.  Then again, the challenge is "Lines", and you''ve captured the lines and made them a central part of the image. So it might just be the right thing :)', '2005-03-17 13:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234585, 155100, 30760, '<td valign="top">A technically good macro, but I feel that the lines flying out of the image is a little disturbing. What about including more of the flower in the shot?<br/> <br/>Nevertheless, a good shot, and it meets the challenge. I like the black background as well.</td>', 'A technically good macro, but I feel that the lines flying out of the image is a little disturbing. What about including more of the flower in the shot? Nevertheless, a good shot, and it meets the challenge. I like the black background as well.', '2005-03-17 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234592, 155396, 30760, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. There''s not too much tonal range in the color, however. I like the composition, but maybe the stepstones could''ve been something else than dead vertical - a slight angle might become more interesting.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. There''s not too much tonal range in the color, however. I like the composition, but maybe the stepstones could''ve been something else than dead vertical - a slight angle might become more interesting.', '2005-03-17 13:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234599, 155424, 30760, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I''m a fan of putting normally interesting subjects in the background, but I don''t think you have found anything interesting in a microphone stand. A good idea that might use some improvement, I think.</td>', 'Hmm... I''m a fan of putting normally interesting subjects in the background, but I don''t think you have found anything interesting in a microphone stand. A good idea that might use some improvement, I think.', '2005-03-17 13:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234602, 154284, 30760, '<td valign="top">I think that this could be composed a little differently. A narrower angle could''ve made it more interesting, and you could have cleaned off the crumbs ;)</td>', 'I think that this could be composed a little differently. A narrower angle could''ve made it more interesting, and you could have cleaned off the crumbs ;)', '2005-03-17 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234603, 154638, 30760, '<td valign="top">A little oversaturated/sharpened, makes it a little unpleasing to the eye. If it was intented, that sure could be used as an effect, though.</td>', 'A little oversaturated/sharpened, makes it a little unpleasing to the eye. If it was intented, that sure could be used as an effect, though.', '2005-03-17 13:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234604, 155666, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nicely comopsed, but the waterfall in the front is the most interesting part of the image that meets the eye. It''s out of focus, which is a pity.</td>', 'Nicely comopsed, but the waterfall in the front is the most interesting part of the image that meets the eye. It''s out of focus, which is a pity.', '2005-03-17 13:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234608, 155242, 30760, '<td valign="top">I think I would like to see the line stop, some negative space in this shot. And, the lighting you use should be set up by you, so you won''t have excessive sunlight in the background :)</td>', 'I think I would like to see the line stop, some negative space in this shot. And, the lighting you use should be set up by you, so you won''t have excessive sunlight in the background :)', '2005-03-17 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234612, 155381, 30760, '<td valign="top">I like this one. One thing though: Maybe you should have lightened up the cross, or exposed it differently, because right now the skies are more evident.</td>', 'I like this one. One thing though: Maybe you should have lightened up the cross, or exposed it differently, because right now the skies are more evident.', '2005-03-17 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234615, 155770, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice "foggy" feel. However, I have problems making my eye meet the closest power pole. Maybe it could be composed differently. If you had the time, the opening in the skies could work as an attractor to either the closest or the farthest pole.</td>', 'Nice "foggy" feel. However, I have problems making my eye meet the closest power pole. Maybe it could be composed differently. If you had the time, the opening in the skies could work as an attractor to either the closest or the farthest pole.', '2005-03-17 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234622, 155443, 30760, '<td valign="top">Who''s Chuck? :)<br/> <br/>There''s a good flow in the image, with the exception of the upper right corner. And the coffee is a little undelicate :P<br/>Maybe some depth of field work could make some part of the image more attractive than the other?</td>', 'Who''s Chuck? :) There''s a good flow in the image, with the exception of the upper right corner. And the coffee is a little undelicate :PMaybe some depth of field work could make some part of the image more attractive than the other?', '2005-03-17 13:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234623, 155696, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition with the various types of lines. I also like the slight burning you did around the perimeter. The only flaw I see are the posts. They look a bit artificial to me. Perhaps a bit too much noise reduction? Otherwise, very welll done! 9</td>', 'Very interesting composition with the various types of lines. I also like the slight burning you did around the perimeter. The only flaw I see are the posts. They look a bit artificial to me. Perhaps a bit too much noise reduction? Otherwise, very welll done! 9', '2005-03-17 13:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234626, 154504, 30760, '<td valign="top">Cute model. Too bad her face isn''t sharp, however the concept of Lines is the most important thing. I don''t see lines as the main thing in the image though.<br/> <br/>Hey, try using her for another challenge later, I think she might look good on photos.</td>', 'Cute model. Too bad her face isn''t sharp, however the concept of Lines is the most important thing. I don''t see lines as the main thing in the image though. Hey, try using her for another challenge later, I think she might look good on photos.', '2005-03-17 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234627, 155579, 30760, '<td valign="top">Gives me the Granny feel. If that''s intented or not, I have no idea ;)</td>', 'Gives me the Granny feel. If that''s intented or not, I have no idea ;)', '2005-03-17 13:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234632, 154627, 30760, '<td valign="top">Might be an interesting idea, but there''s no depth to the image. The square composition doesn''t work too well either for me. <br/> <br/>Try to shoot it again using more light, and make a concept out of the lines. It could be a mess, but try to make order in it :)</td>', 'Might be an interesting idea, but there''s no depth to the image. The square composition doesn''t work too well either for me.  Try to shoot it again using more light, and make a concept out of the lines. It could be a mess, but try to make order in it :)', '2005-03-17 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234633, 155222, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very striking - well executed. Looks like you''ve used the same kind of torch is mine on my photo, ''The Last Breath''. You''ve managed to hold a neat line and the model has been still too - my only criticism is the face - I''d prefer either complete silhouette or a bit more detail to be visible.</td>', 'Very striking - well executed. Looks like you''ve used the same kind of torch is mine on my photo, ''The Last Breath''. You''ve managed to hold a neat line and the model has been still too - my only criticism is the face - I''d prefer either complete silhouette or a bit more detail to be visible.', '2005-03-17 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234637, 154807, 8860, '<td valign="top">Repeating th challenge theme in the title is a pet hate of mine (!) but your shot features a novel line and this is a nice bit of photojournalism. Image is quite bright and you have a few blown highlights. A higher viewpoint would have been even better.</td>', 'Repeating th challenge theme in the title is a pet hate of mine (!) but your shot features a novel line and this is a nice bit of photojournalism. Image is quite bright and you have a few blown highlights. A higher viewpoint would have been even better.', '2005-03-17 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234639, 154249, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strong textures and light.</td>', 'Strong textures and light.', '2005-03-17 13:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234644, 153928, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the contemporary feel of this composition. What would it look like in mono? I have a feeling that it could look more potent.</td>', 'Love the contemporary feel of this composition. What would it look like in mono? I have a feeling that it could look more potent.', '2005-03-17 13:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234647, 154657, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very good viewpoint and DOF. Lighting really helps make this special.</td>', 'Very good viewpoint and DOF. Lighting really helps make this special.', '2005-03-17 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234650, 154860, 30760, '<td valign="top">This image tells a story, and has a punch to it. I like the selective desat too.<br/> <br/>The first thought that hits me is using some more of the negative space you have, by putting the subject slightly more to the right.</td>', 'This image tells a story, and has a punch to it. I like the selective desat too. The first thought that hits me is using some more of the negative space you have, by putting the subject slightly more to the right.', '2005-03-17 13:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234660, 154394, 29477, '<td valign="top">Like the effect of the wisk "breaking the plain" of the jello and reflecting off the glass.  Definately a lot going on here and the measuring cup lines clutters the image.  A clear mixing bowl may have helped. Good Luck</td>', 'Like the effect of the wisk "breaking the plain" of the jello and reflecting off the glass.  Definately a lot going on here and the measuring cup lines clutters the image.  A clear mixing bowl may have helped. Good Luck', '2005-03-17 13:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234664, 154692, 29477, '<td valign="top">The sunset appears over exposed and appears to be fire.  I do like the composition and isolation of the power lines.  wish it was taken 10 - 20 minutes early.  Good Luck.</td>', 'The sunset appears over exposed and appears to be fire.  I do like the composition and isolation of the power lines.  wish it was taken 10 - 20 minutes early.  Good Luck.', '2005-03-17 13:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
