(1234667, 155184, 29477, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see how this does, as I had a similar image that I ended up not submitting at the last second.  Nicely done, I think a B&amp;W or desaturated version may have added some more depth and volume, however I do like the colours here.  Good Luck.</td>', 'Can''t wait to see how this does, as I had a similar image that I ended up not submitting at the last second.  Nicely done, I think a B&W or desaturated version may have added some more depth and volume, however I do like the colours here.  Good Luck.', '2005-03-17 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234669, 155483, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot and architecture.  Lines are well represented here.</td>', 'Great shot and architecture.  Lines are well represented here.', '2005-03-17 13:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
