(1234687, 155461, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in the image, and good bokeh. I''d like a 3:2 crop though, where there''s a little background on the left of her face too. But there''s really good detail and a good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice tones in the image, and good bokeh. I''d like a 3:2 crop though, where there''s a little background on the left of her face too. But there''s really good detail and a good interpretation of the challenge.', '2005-03-17 13:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234688, 155519, 13749, '<td valign="top">almost looks like a lake reflection.  i like the green tone here.. esp. cuz it''s st. patty''s day!  in all seriousness, it does add a sense of intrigue here for me.</td>', 'almost looks like a lake reflection.  i like the green tone here.. esp. cuz it''s st. patty''s day!  in all seriousness, it does add a sense of intrigue here for me.', '2005-03-17 13:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
