(1234783, 154657, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice background, and the flower in the back adds up. However, I think the image could''ve had some more contrast and some work to make the flashy colors more interesting.</td>', 'Nice background, and the flower in the back adds up. However, I think the image could''ve had some more contrast and some work to make the flashy colors more interesting.', '2005-03-17 14:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234786, 154417, 24784, '<td valign="top">great ... original</td>', 'great ... original', '2005-03-17 14:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234788, 155694, 30760, '<td valign="top">It''s not entirely clear what you are trying to say in this image. Try to preemptively think what you want to say with an image - then capture. There are lines, sure, but I can''t tell what they''re supposed to do there. To me, simplicity and a meaning is important. The meaning can be deep, but I suspect that the depth of the meaning does not surpass me ;)</td>', 'It''s not entirely clear what you are trying to say in this image. Try to preemptively think what you want to say with an image - then capture. There are lines, sure, but I can''t tell what they''re supposed to do there. To me, simplicity and a meaning is important. The meaning can be deep, but I suspect that the depth of the meaning does not surpass me ;)', '2005-03-17 14:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234790, 155639, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice work. The color in the eye is great, and the glass in front adds up.<br/>However, I''m not that much a fan of the framing, I think it steals from the shot. Good detail, and very good focus. One suggestion would be to capture it so that the eye and the shattered glass would both be in the focus field. The glass is sharp at the middle, but it gets a little disturbingly blurry further to the left.</td>', 'Nice work. The color in the eye is great, and the glass in front adds up.However, I''m not that much a fan of the framing, I think it steals from the shot. Good detail, and very good focus. One suggestion would be to capture it so that the eye and the shattered glass would both be in the focus field. The glass is sharp at the middle, but it gets a little disturbingly blurry further to the left.', '2005-03-17 14:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234791, 155227, 30760, '<td valign="top">Good color. However, I think the crop is too tight, you can''t really tell exactly what this is except from some kind of flower. I miss some room.</td>', 'Good color. However, I think the crop is too tight, you can''t really tell exactly what this is except from some kind of flower. I miss some room.', '2005-03-17 14:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234792, 155590, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice color, and very good contrast. The light is also very nice. The only think I can think of right here is that the sky could be bluer, but to get that out of the camera you''d need a polarizer.</td>', 'Nice color, and very good contrast. The light is also very nice. The only think I can think of right here is that the sky could be bluer, but to get that out of the camera you''d need a polarizer.', '2005-03-17 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234794, 155535, 30760, '<td valign="top">Humorous :) <br/>You might want a bit more depth though, as the birdies aren''t entirely sharp. I like the crop though.</td>', 'Humorous :) You might want a bit more depth though, as the birdies aren''t entirely sharp. I like the crop though.', '2005-03-17 14:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
