(1234807, 155044, 30760, '<td valign="top">Took me a second here to understand what it was, without looking at the title. Very basic message though, this sure is your broom outside ;)</td>', 'Took me a second here to understand what it was, without looking at the title. Very basic message though, this sure is your broom outside ;)', '2005-03-17 14:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234808, 154715, 30760, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation, a little sneaky though. Could do with some more depth, the right eye is out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation, a little sneaky though. Could do with some more depth, the right eye is out of focus.', '2005-03-17 14:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234812, 154929, 30760, '<td valign="top">I like this image. My only problem is that there''s not enough depth, and since the leaf is pretty much flat, I think it looks a little bit weird when the bottom right and the parts closest to the paper are out of focus. Well composed though.</td>', 'I like this image. My only problem is that there''s not enough depth, and since the leaf is pretty much flat, I think it looks a little bit weird when the bottom right and the parts closest to the paper are out of focus. Well composed though.', '2005-03-17 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234814, 155265, 30760, '<td valign="top">hmm... Not sure if I think the selective desat works here. Since parts of the city is included, it looks kinda weird. I''d like to see it in color, with some extra saturation on the red channel, possibly.</td>', 'hmm... Not sure if I think the selective desat works here. Since parts of the city is included, it looks kinda weird. I''d like to see it in color, with some extra saturation on the red channel, possibly.', '2005-03-17 14:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234817, 155395, 30760, '<td valign="top">You''ll never manage to pull that back, willya ;)</td>', 'You''ll never manage to pull that back, willya ;)', '2005-03-17 14:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234819, 154698, 30760, '<td valign="top">Good title, nice color and a very good contrast between the cars and the sharp grass and tree. I like the composition as well.</td>', 'Good title, nice color and a very good contrast between the cars and the sharp grass and tree. I like the composition as well.', '2005-03-17 14:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234820, 154959, 30760, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the bird with a german uniform :)</td>', 'Good capture of the bird with a german uniform :)', '2005-03-17 14:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234822, 155337, 30760, '<td valign="top">I''d think this was a little more exciting if the whole web was in focus, and you could''ve worked a bit on the highlights as the spider looks a bit overexposed. A nice image overall though.</td>', 'I''d think this was a little more exciting if the whole web was in focus, and you could''ve worked a bit on the highlights as the spider looks a bit overexposed. A nice image overall though.', '2005-03-17 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234829, 155687, 30760, '<td valign="top">Good use of selective desat. The eye could''ve been sharper though. Cute cat :)</td>', 'Good use of selective desat. The eye could''ve been sharper though. Cute cat :)', '2005-03-17 15:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234832, 155129, 30760, '<td valign="top">Simple, and good. It doesn''t wow me, but it''s nice.</td>', 'Simple, and good. It doesn''t wow me, but it''s nice.', '2005-03-17 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234833, 155099, 32872, '<td valign="top">cool macro shot!<br/></td>', 'cool macro shot!', '2005-03-17 15:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234834, 155373, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nature makes all her creations unique... Good composition, interesting placement of the insect. The crop works, but I think it''d be just as good in 3:2. There''s a slight flaring or something from the lens that you could clone away in a finished version though.</td>', 'Nature makes all her creations unique... Good composition, interesting placement of the insect. The crop works, but I think it''d be just as good in 3:2. There''s a slight flaring or something from the lens that you could clone away in a finished version though.', '2005-03-17 15:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234836, 155625, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice, like abstract art. :)<br/> <br/>I like the colors, too<br/></td>', 'Nice, like abstract art. :) I like the colors, too', '2005-03-17 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234837, 155567, 30760, '<td valign="top">The girder is a little oversaturated, but this is an interesting shot. If you cropped it a tad more, the girder would be more like a frame. Since the background is entirely black and doesn''t disturb, I think you could add a little more depth to make the snake completely in focus.</td>', 'The girder is a little oversaturated, but this is an interesting shot. If you cropped it a tad more, the girder would be more like a frame. Since the background is entirely black and doesn''t disturb, I think you could add a little more depth to make the snake completely in focus.', '2005-03-17 15:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234842, 154572, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice lightning! I can think of a few things I''d do, like clone away minor parts that aren''t really visible. Overall, a good capture and creative lightning.</td>', 'Nice lightning! I can think of a few things I''d do, like clone away minor parts that aren''t really visible. Overall, a good capture and creative lightning.', '2005-03-17 15:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234846, 153666, 32872, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I see you do your research, as well ! ! !<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Clever.  I see you do your research, as well ! ! !   ', '2005-03-17 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234847, 155626, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. But, I think I''d like to see this is color, or tritone, because the metal could give some creative lighting possibilities.</td>', 'Nice idea. But, I think I''d like to see this is color, or tritone, because the metal could give some creative lighting possibilities.', '2005-03-17 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234848, 155599, 27399, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Really great shot!  There is almost an optical illusion (until you scroll down, or eye gets down far enough to see the window on the bottom) that the building is rising on the left and right and you are looking straight out from a balcony.  At first it just appears like an OK photo, but then the eye starts to decipher all the lines, most importantly those which frame the sky (great composition).  This is one of my favorites that I have seen not only in this challenge, but overall.  Good job!</td>', 'Wow!  Really great shot!  There is almost an optical illusion (until you scroll down, or eye gets down far enough to see the window on the bottom) that the building is rising on the left and right and you are looking straight out from a balcony.  At first it just appears like an OK photo, but then the eye starts to decipher all the lines, most importantly those which frame the sky (great composition).  This is one of my favorites that I have seen not only in this challenge, but overall.  Good job!', '2005-03-17 15:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234849, 155415, 6999, '<td valign="top">A very tricky situation to expose correctly - that snow immediately behind the swans is always going to make things hard, and they''re not the easiest creatures to photograph anyway, given the white plumage. You''ve allowed the highlights to gotoo far, for me: not so much on the birds, which would (just) be OK, but certainly in the snow. I think the solution is to under-expose more, and then select and bring back the brightness in the birds heads whilst trying to maintain a sense of the real. This is not a bad go though.</td>', 'A very tricky situation to expose correctly - that snow immediately behind the swans is always going to make things hard, and they''re not the easiest creatures to photograph anyway, given the white plumage. You''ve allowed the highlights to gotoo far, for me: not so much on the birds, which would (just) be OK, but certainly in the snow. I think the solution is to under-expose more, and then select and bring back the brightness in the birds heads whilst trying to maintain a sense of the real. This is not a bad go though.', '2005-03-17 15:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234853, 155377, 30760, '<td valign="top">Ah, Iceland :)<br/> <br/>Kind of a double meaning, the image is a little flat to me though. Could use some contrast</td>', 'Ah, Iceland :) Kind of a double meaning, the image is a little flat to me though. Could use some contrast', '2005-03-17 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234859, 155531, 30760, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the chuckle :)</td>', 'Thanks for the chuckle :)', '2005-03-17 15:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234860, 155028, 32872, '<td valign="top">cute dog...great photo!<br/></td>', 'cute dog...great photo!', '2005-03-17 15:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234863, 155597, 30760, '<td valign="top">The photoshopping here is a little overdone I think, but could look nice on the image in more moderate amounts.<br/> <br/>What are the lines you thought of, by the way? Could be many.</td>', 'The photoshopping here is a little overdone I think, but could look nice on the image in more moderate amounts. What are the lines you thought of, by the way? Could be many.', '2005-03-17 15:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234869, 155543, 32872, '<td valign="top">Very cool and creative.  You really do capture the essense of lines!<br/></td>', 'Very cool and creative.  You really do capture the essense of lines!', '2005-03-17 15:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234874, 155746, 30760, '<td valign="top">I like the toning. I think you could have underexposed this a little bit though, to keep the shadow detail.</td>', 'I like the toning. I think you could have underexposed this a little bit though, to keep the shadow detail.', '2005-03-17 15:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234875, 155144, 32872, '<td valign="top">Lovely.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Lovely. ', '2005-03-17 15:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234876, 155217, 30760, '<td valign="top">Eek, mindkiller ;)</td>', 'Eek, mindkiller ;)', '2005-03-17 15:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234879, 154948, 30760, '<td valign="top">Hey, almost Ansel style. Nice BW conversion, job well done. I''d wish that the center part of the image could be either closer or more visible, though.</td>', 'Hey, almost Ansel style. Nice BW conversion, job well done. I''d wish that the center part of the image could be either closer or more visible, though.', '2005-03-17 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234881, 154963, 30760, '<td valign="top">The negative space is more interesting to me than the road, so maybe the composition could have been lifted up a little.</td>', 'The negative space is more interesting to me than the road, so maybe the composition could have been lifted up a little.', '2005-03-17 15:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234882, 155089, 32872, '<td valign="top">Interesting.<br/></td>', 'Interesting.', '2005-03-17 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234888, 155444, 30760, '<td valign="top">I miss a subject a bit closer to the foreground, but otherwise a good image that shows motion.</td>', 'I miss a subject a bit closer to the foreground, but otherwise a good image that shows motion.', '2005-03-17 15:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234893, 155365, 32872, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  Love the reflection of the cloud and how you can see the lines inside the building.<br/></td>', 'Pretty.  Love the reflection of the cloud and how you can see the lines inside the building.', '2005-03-17 15:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234898, 154945, 30760, '<td valign="top">Wow. Hard-hitting. Really tells the tale. It''s not a fantastic photograph technically, but that''s a good message.</td>', 'Wow. Hard-hitting. Really tells the tale. It''s not a fantastic photograph technically, but that''s a good message.', '2005-03-17 15:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234911, 155398, 30760, '<td valign="top">This might be technical, since it requires expensive equipment, but the lens could be set at an aperture where it''s sharper. And, it could possibly be cropped slightly more to emphasize the airplane.</td>', 'This might be technical, since it requires expensive equipment, but the lens could be set at an aperture where it''s sharper. And, it could possibly be cropped slightly more to emphasize the airplane.', '2005-03-17 15:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234917, 155531, 31443, '<td valign="top">Pleasure to look at....</td>', 'Pleasure to look at....', '2005-03-17 15:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234945, 155209, 31443, '<td valign="top">Not very clear but I like the warm colors, wish you had set your aperture a bit higher to get the depth of field</td>', 'Not very clear but I like the warm colors, wish you had set your aperture a bit higher to get the depth of field', '2005-03-17 16:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234956, 155729, 14614, '<td valign="top">not an easy shot timing wise - good catch.  like the crisp colors</td>', 'not an easy shot timing wise - good catch.  like the crisp colors', '2005-03-17 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234957, 155758, 14614, '<td valign="top">love the light and the wood - too bac about the leg in the upper left as it detracts from the composition</td>', 'love the light and the wood - too bac about the leg in the upper left as it detracts from the composition', '2005-03-17 16:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1234959, 155669, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderfule color, great background, super use of light.  nice job on this macro</td>', 'wonderfule color, great background, super use of light.  nice job on this macro', '2005-03-17 16:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
