(1235005, 154263, 30760, '<td valign="top">This is a very well done work, especially without advanced editing. Good contrast, very good detail, and perfect focus.</td>', 'This is a very well done work, especially without advanced editing. Good contrast, very good detail, and perfect focus.', '2005-03-17 16:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235009, 155144, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I''d wish to see the foreground a bit lighter.</td>', 'Nice image, but I''d wish to see the foreground a bit lighter.', '2005-03-17 16:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235016, 153666, 30760, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail made me think this was a macro of a tip of a pen on paper. Impressive, good light, good detail.</td>', 'The thumbnail made me think this was a macro of a tip of a pen on paper. Impressive, good light, good detail.', '2005-03-17 16:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235023, 155772, 30760, '<td valign="top">I think the point of the image would be illustrated just as well with a closer crop.</td>', 'I think the point of the image would be illustrated just as well with a closer crop.', '2005-03-17 16:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235028, 155222, 32644, '<td valign="top">How was this done???</td>', 'How was this done???', '2005-03-17 16:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235033, 154319, 30760, '<td valign="top">Great tone and contrast! There''s quite a lot of noise in the sky, while the rest of the image is/appears clean. Maybe you could just blur it out? Good composition as well.</td>', 'Great tone and contrast! There''s quite a lot of noise in the sky, while the rest of the image is/appears clean. Maybe you could just blur it out? Good composition as well.', '2005-03-17 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235046, 154437, 30760, '<td valign="top">Good macro. I love the reflection, trying to figure out what it is. A kindergarden perhaps? :)</td>', 'Good macro. I love the reflection, trying to figure out what it is. A kindergarden perhaps? :)', '2005-03-17 17:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235061, 155414, 30760, '<td valign="top">Good title, and a well working selective desaturation. I would''ve darkened out the light at the upper right, though.</td>', 'Good title, and a well working selective desaturation. I would''ve darkened out the light at the upper right, though.', '2005-03-17 17:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235081, 155597, 13749, '<td valign="top">lines of the landscape?  can''t tell - for more ambiguous connections like this, it''s probably better to specify what lines you''re talking about somehow in the title to help us out.  colors are a bit oversaturated for my taste - think it would look good if they were a bit more muted.</td>', 'lines of the landscape?  can''t tell - for more ambiguous connections like this, it''s probably better to specify what lines you''re talking about somehow in the title to help us out.  colors are a bit oversaturated for my taste - think it would look good if they were a bit more muted.', '2005-03-17 17:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235085, 155498, 13749, '<td valign="top">wonderful job, although i wonder if the placement of her foot leads the eye out of the frame a bit for some.</td>', 'wonderful job, although i wonder if the placement of her foot leads the eye out of the frame a bit for some.', '2005-03-17 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235087, 154437, 13749, '<td valign="top">fantastic image.  i would''ve perhaps named it "line of sight" or something similar in order to make the connection more obvious (although perhaps that wasn''t the line you were intending to depict).  great use of selective desat here.</td>', 'fantastic image.  i would''ve perhaps named it "line of sight" or something similar in order to make the connection more obvious (although perhaps that wasn''t the line you were intending to depict).  great use of selective desat here.', '2005-03-17 17:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235095, 155687, 13749, '<td valign="top">seems a tad blurry or out of focus in many areas, but wonderful tones and color.</td>', 'seems a tad blurry or out of focus in many areas, but wonderful tones and color.', '2005-03-17 17:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235097, 154747, 30760, '<td valign="top">Great motion capture, but isn''t the main subject the horizon, if that''s your line?</td>', 'Great motion capture, but isn''t the main subject the horizon, if that''s your line?', '2005-03-17 17:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235098, 154394, 13749, '<td valign="top">wow, i thought this was some strange humongous jello making vat/machine until i noticed the writing on the side and now realize what everything is.  very interesting presentation, good job (though i sort of wish the bubbles or whatever they are at the top left were not there).</td>', 'wow, i thought this was some strange humongous jello making vat/machine until i noticed the writing on the side and now realize what everything is.  very interesting presentation, good job (though i sort of wish the bubbles or whatever they are at the top left were not there).', '2005-03-17 17:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235100, 154164, 13749, '<td valign="top">very creative interpretation.. 2X the lines!  and nice use of DOF as well, imo.</td>', 'very creative interpretation.. 2X the lines!  and nice use of DOF as well, imo.', '2005-03-17 17:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235122, 155486, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nicely done desat while maintaining good contrast. I think if you used a smaller aperture you could have kept the foreground in focus, as well. Might have looked better that way since the lines are so close to the viewer.</td>', 'Nicely done desat while maintaining good contrast. I think if you used a smaller aperture you could have kept the foreground in focus, as well. Might have looked better that way since the lines are so close to the viewer.', '2005-03-17 17:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235129, 155770, 8054, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and strong on the dark and gloomy feel. The trees/plants in the foreground are distracting and seem to detract from the overall feel and focal point which are the power lines. If you cropped the left side almost all the way to the second tower and then eliminated the plants, might score higher with me. Of course you''d have to do some cloning to get rid of the plants by the second tower. Nice start, though!</td>', 'Interesting composition and strong on the dark and gloomy feel. The trees/plants in the foreground are distracting and seem to detract from the overall feel and focal point which are the power lines. If you cropped the left side almost all the way to the second tower and then eliminated the plants, might score higher with me. Of course you''d have to do some cloning to get rid of the plants by the second tower. Nice start, though!', '2005-03-17 17:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235135, 155597, 8054, '<td valign="top">Looks highly overprocessed. Colors are too saturated and the dodging is quite obvious around the yucca plant and the windmill.</td>', 'Looks highly overprocessed. Colors are too saturated and the dodging is quite obvious around the yucca plant and the windmill.', '2005-03-17 18:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235142, 155710, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of shallow DOF but it seems to emphasize the rake tool vs the lines in the sand. Composition, color and lighting all seem fine. Border is creative and matches the photo well.</td>', 'Very nice use of shallow DOF but it seems to emphasize the rake tool vs the lines in the sand. Composition, color and lighting all seem fine. Border is creative and matches the photo well.', '2005-03-17 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235144, 154306, 33359, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here.  Colorful &amp; Simple, but yet a very nice image.</td>', 'I really like the idea here.  Colorful & Simple, but yet a very nice image.', '2005-03-17 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235149, 155028, 33359, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, love the LINES</td>', 'Nice photo, love the LINES', '2005-03-17 18:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235151, 154585, 30760, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but I''d either black out the mountain completely to make a silhouette, or lighten up the dark parts of it. I''d probably go for the silhouette solution. Might also be a good idea to switch the blueish tones to something closer to the rest of the sky.</td>', 'Nice colors, but I''d either black out the mountain completely to make a silhouette, or lighten up the dark parts of it. I''d probably go for the silhouette solution. Might also be a good idea to switch the blueish tones to something closer to the rest of the sky.', '2005-03-17 18:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235155, 155188, 33359, '<td valign="top">My favorite way to relax LINES.  Love the idea !!</td>', 'My favorite way to relax LINES.  Love the idea !!', '2005-03-17 18:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235161, 155486, 33359, '<td valign="top">love the angle of these LINES.  Great job!</td>', 'love the angle of these LINES.  Great job!', '2005-03-17 18:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235169, 155744, 33359, '<td valign="top">I love the colors here.  Great Job!  BEAUTIFUL BACKGROUND WITH LINES</td>', 'I love the colors here.  Great Job!  BEAUTIFUL BACKGROUND WITH LINES', '2005-03-17 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
