(1235252, 155746, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful softness. I love it as is.. but wonder if it would be better with a different subject, like a boy in overalls or something just to add a little bit more flare. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful softness. I love it as is.. but wonder if it would be better with a different subject, like a boy in overalls or something just to add a little bit more flare. 9.', '2005-03-17 19:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
