(1235867, 154263, 8759, '<td valign="top">Very strong portrait. A wonderful  techinique of black and white.  Wish you luck. 10</td>', 'Very strong portrait. A wonderful  techinique of black and white.  Wish you luck. 10', '2005-03-18 04:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235872, 155026, 6999, '<td valign="top">That gentle halo-ing around the figure is effective, even if it feels like slightly over-doing things. I wonder whether your highlights, for web display at least, haven''t been taken just the smallest touch too far - this is a very minor observation, but in such a very controlled and precise image, I think it matters. Good light, and the blue/grey tonality is very fine. It''s a beautiful thing - I wonder how many folks will hit you for lack of lines? Not me ...</td>', 'That gentle halo-ing around the figure is effective, even if it feels like slightly over-doing things. I wonder whether your highlights, for web display at least, haven''t been taken just the smallest touch too far - this is a very minor observation, but in such a very controlled and precise image, I think it matters. Good light, and the blue/grey tonality is very fine. It''s a beautiful thing - I wonder how many folks will hit you for lack of lines? Not me ...', '2005-03-18 05:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235873, 155428, 6999, '<td valign="top">Your extreme sharpness, and contrast, makes this a near-abstract - and not one that I don''t like. even at a reasonable viewing distance, it appears to be simply an oganisation of white pixels on a black background. Quite fun, but I prefer more sensation of depth, progression, in photography: this moves too far to the purely graphic for my taste - but of that ''type'' of shot, I would place this quite highly.</td>', 'Your extreme sharpness, and contrast, makes this a near-abstract - and not one that I don''t like. even at a reasonable viewing distance, it appears to be simply an oganisation of white pixels on a black background. Quite fun, but I prefer more sensation of depth, progression, in photography: this moves too far to the purely graphic for my taste - but of that ''type'' of shot, I would place this quite highly.', '2005-03-18 05:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235874, 154898, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m no fan of this stuff, generally. That''s not a reference to the ''seen before'' thing, but the type of shiny designer photography. There are a couple of areas where it falls down, I think; firstly, there just isn''t the punch of colour these things cry out for - here, they seem washed out, muted. Secondly, the fold line of your background seems out of place with the curves and graduations of the glass: if you could have held it so that it curved round, rather than folding ...</td>', 'I''m no fan of this stuff, generally. That''s not a reference to the ''seen before'' thing, but the type of shiny designer photography. There are a couple of areas where it falls down, I think; firstly, there just isn''t the punch of colour these things cry out for - here, they seem washed out, muted. Secondly, the fold line of your background seems out of place with the curves and graduations of the glass: if you could have held it so that it curved round, rather than folding ...', '2005-03-18 05:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235894, 154873, 14614, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle on the flag.  A suggestion: your background detracts from the interesting folds in the flag - perhaps some level adjustment or dodge tool would help lessen it.</td>', 'Interesting angle on the flag.  A suggestion: your background detracts from the interesting folds in the flag - perhaps some level adjustment or dodge tool would help lessen it.', '2005-03-18 06:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235896, 153883, 14614, '<td valign="top">creative use of light and an "everyday" object -- fog adds to the mood</td>', 'creative use of light and an "everyday" object -- fog adds to the mood', '2005-03-18 06:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235899, 154414, 14614, '<td valign="top">interesting pattern for the abstract effect, like the color choice</td>', 'interesting pattern for the abstract effect, like the color choice', '2005-03-18 06:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235900, 154947, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like your study of lines and angles - b&amp;w treatment works as it brings out the details in a more abstract way.</td>', 'I like your study of lines and angles - b&w treatment works as it brings out the details in a more abstract way.', '2005-03-18 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235901, 155567, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a uniquly interesting shot here.  Great use of color and line, different textures form a nice contrast.  Only detraction is that focus seems a bit soft in spots</td>', 'You''ve captured a uniquly interesting shot here.  Great use of color and line, different textures form a nice contrast.  Only detraction is that focus seems a bit soft in spots', '2005-03-18 07:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235902, 155410, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like your composition -- the curved snow bank keeps the shot interesting and the grey/white tones keep it simple</td>', 'I like your composition -- the curved snow bank keeps the shot interesting and the grey/white tones keep it simple', '2005-03-18 07:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235933, 155543, 16636, '<td valign="top">love this, what a great idea.</td>', 'love this, what a great idea.', '2005-03-18 08:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235936, 155405, 16636, '<td valign="top">you,ve cropped well to enhance the subject, nice image</td>', 'you,ve cropped well to enhance the subject, nice image', '2005-03-18 08:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235937, 154777, 19978, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful idea but I think the execution could have been improved. The lighting is too irregular and the large shadowy areas on the left detract from the regular, patterned appearance. The dof is a little too shallow too. I think you might have zoomed in closer, fewer pencils (or whatever) and brought out more detail and sharpness. Together with more uniform lighting, it could''ve been a visually arresting photo. As is, it''s interesting, but not quite there...</td>', 'This is a wonderful idea but I think the execution could have been improved. The lighting is too irregular and the large shadowy areas on the left detract from the regular, patterned appearance. The dof is a little too shallow too. I think you might have zoomed in closer, fewer pencils (or whatever) and brought out more detail and sharpness. Together with more uniform lighting, it could''ve been a visually arresting photo. As is, it''s interesting, but not quite there...', '2005-03-18 08:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235938, 155667, 19978, '<td valign="top">The flower petals got just a little too overexposed, didn''t they? Nice composition and good soft bokeh in the back.</td>', 'The flower petals got just a little too overexposed, didn''t they? Nice composition and good soft bokeh in the back.', '2005-03-18 08:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235940, 155474, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great idea but a detailed study of a textured subject like this cries out for sharp, SHARP focus and contrasting tones that just leap off the monitor. This image doesn''t quite get there.</td>', 'Great idea but a detailed study of a textured subject like this cries out for sharp, SHARP focus and contrasting tones that just leap off the monitor. This image doesn''t quite get there.', '2005-03-18 08:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235941, 155265, 33515, '<td valign="top">The desaturation is more distracting than anything</td>', 'The desaturation is more distracting than anything', '2005-03-18 08:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235942, 155746, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice, a very dreamy, emotive look. Beautiful comp and NICE use of line. Super job. Don''t let the "needs better focus" crowd get to you. This is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice, a very dreamy, emotive look. Beautiful comp and NICE use of line. Super job. Don''t let the "needs better focus" crowd get to you. This is a great shot.', '2005-03-18 08:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235943, 154437, 19978, '<td valign="top">I really, really want to like this image, but something just doesn''t click for me. I''m sure it has something to do with the extremely shallow dof. So much of the detail of the eye is lost in the front and back. I''m sure you were intending the very singular focus on the saturated portion of the eyeball, but I think you would have gotten more ''wow'' if the other parts of the eye had been gently (not dramatically) defocused. On the other hand, the portions of the skin just below, and to the top left, that are in sharp focus add a tantalizing element of wonder, and give the eye places to stop and rest as it roams over the photo. I''ve been back to this entry several times (remember, I REALLY want to like it) and haven''t tired of looking yet. I just think it could have been stronger...</td>', 'I really, really want to like this image, but something just doesn''t click for me. I''m sure it has something to do with the extremely shallow dof. So much of the detail of the eye is lost in the front and back. I''m sure you were intending the very singular focus on the saturated portion of the eyeball, but I think you would have gotten more ''wow'' if the other parts of the eye had been gently (not dramatically) defocused. On the other hand, the portions of the skin just below, and to the top left, that are in sharp focus add a tantalizing element of wonder, and give the eye places to stop and rest as it roams over the photo. I''ve been back to this entry several times (remember, I REALLY want to like it) and haven''t tired of looking yet. I just think it could have been stronger...', '2005-03-18 08:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235969, 155630, 14735, '<td valign="top">Didn''t care for the close-up on the foourground. The color comes out different and distracts from the photo instead of enhance it</td>', 'Didn''t care for the close-up on the foourground. The color comes out different and distracts from the photo instead of enhance it', '2005-03-18 09:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235971, 154912, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great Perspective.  Love the contrast between the rocket and gorgeous blue sky. Good Luck.</td>', 'Great Perspective.  Love the contrast between the rocket and gorgeous blue sky. Good Luck.', '2005-03-18 09:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235973, 155486, 14735, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation really works nice here. The slight up hill grade adds to the length of the lines nice photo</td>', 'The selective desaturation really works nice here. The slight up hill grade adds to the length of the lines nice photo', '2005-03-18 09:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235975, 155374, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the way the clouds give the bridge that soft light. I think it would have been better if you took the shot strainght on. Nice job though. 6</td>', 'I like the way the clouds give the bridge that soft light. I think it would have been better if you took the shot strainght on. Nice job though. 6', '2005-03-18 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1235978, 154974, 14735, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is wonderful, great color.</td>', 'The lighting on this is wonderful, great color.', '2005-03-18 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
