(1236413, 155354, 31133, '<td valign="top">My eye is unfortunately drawn to the reflelction in the lower left of the left blind. Otherwise, I think this is a cool shot - the light is good, as is the color change to green near the top third of the frame.</td>', 'My eye is unfortunately drawn to the reflelction in the lower left of the left blind. Otherwise, I think this is a cool shot - the light is good, as is the color change to green near the top third of the frame.', '2005-03-18 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
