(1237118, 155044, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a simple subject made into an interesting image!</td>', 'Nice to see a simple subject made into an interesting image!', '2005-03-19 01:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237146, 155674, 31133, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, nice to see something different. I love the bridge support deal (no idea what they''re called - frets, maybe?) on the far right. The curvey one. It has a more natural  looking translucence that I''d like to see in the other five fret deals.  Actually, I''d love to see that same translucence in the whole image, strings included. But please take my comments with a grain of salt. I definitely wouldn''t write so much if I didn''t really have something to say here anyway - your picture has moved me.</td>', 'Interesting abstract, nice to see something different. I love the bridge support deal (no idea what they''re called - frets, maybe?) on the far right. The curvey one. It has a more natural  looking translucence that I''d like to see in the other five fret deals.  Actually, I''d love to see that same translucence in the whole image, strings included. But please take my comments with a grain of salt. I definitely wouldn''t write so much if I didn''t really have something to say here anyway - your picture has moved me.', '2005-03-19 01:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237148, 155754, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a nice mountain shot. Did you desat the mountain? If so, I''m curious how the original looked.</td>', 'What a nice mountain shot. Did you desat the mountain? If so, I''m curious how the original looked.', '2005-03-19 01:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237153, 154117, 31133, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far. It''s more digital art than a regular photo, but that doesn''t make me love it any less. The colors are fantastic. As for the lines, it''s the big round columns in the back that make this shot extra special. Good job!</td>', 'One of my favorites so far. It''s more digital art than a regular photo, but that doesn''t make me love it any less. The colors are fantastic. As for the lines, it''s the big round columns in the back that make this shot extra special. Good job!', '2005-03-19 01:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237155, 155745, 31133, '<td valign="top">Does this guy have something in his mouth? The bird is very good (sharp and great colors) and I love this image overall. You might also have benefited from cloning out some of the imperfections, particulary in the snow,, such as the small black and watery dots.</td>', 'Does this guy have something in his mouth? The bird is very good (sharp and great colors) and I love this image overall. You might also have benefited from cloning out some of the imperfections, particulary in the snow,, such as the small black and watery dots.', '2005-03-19 01:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237159, 155440, 31133, '<td valign="top">The lines really pop out of the screen! This is one shot that truly has that extra "wow" factor. Nice work. (If one were to be extremely picky, then the blur should be more smooth on the left side - I can see the photoshop work.)</td>', 'The lines really pop out of the screen! This is one shot that truly has that extra "wow" factor. Nice work. (If one were to be extremely picky, then the blur should be more smooth on the left side - I can see the photoshop work.)', '2005-03-19 01:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237164, 155723, 31133, '<td valign="top">Now I understand the comments I''ve received about my backgrounds... This is a shot that I could''ve taken, but since I didn''t, I can see that the background is a too distracting. Those beautifully sharp, light-colored needles would look better against a darker and more uniform background.</td>', 'Now I understand the comments I''ve received about my backgrounds... This is a shot that I could''ve taken, but since I didn''t, I can see that the background is a too distracting. Those beautifully sharp, light-colored needles would look better against a darker and more uniform background.', '2005-03-19 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237167, 154263, 31133, '<td valign="top">This picture really tells a story. What a wonderful model you have here. Nice job catching his eyes!</td>', 'This picture really tells a story. What a wonderful model you have here. Nice job catching his eyes!', '2005-03-19 01:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237173, 155531, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is sooo cool! You''re providing a nice lesson on the rule of thirds as well. I love how you captured / cropped the birds to take up the complete breadth of the frame. The white on the water surface helps lead the eye to the wave''s edge and then to the world''s cutest line of birds.</td>', 'This is sooo cool! You''re providing a nice lesson on the rule of thirds as well. I love how you captured / cropped the birds to take up the complete breadth of the frame. The white on the water surface helps lead the eye to the wave''s edge and then to the world''s cutest line of birds.', '2005-03-19 02:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237175, 155224, 31133, '<td valign="top">The sky is perfect. The fence is a good subject, but it looks like you may have missed on the focus or post-processing somehow. It''s a good composition and I think if the fence were a bit less burnt, it would just "pop" in a nice way.</td>', 'The sky is perfect. The fence is a good subject, but it looks like you may have missed on the focus or post-processing somehow. It''s a good composition and I think if the fence were a bit less burnt, it would just "pop" in a nice way.', '2005-03-19 02:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
