(1237671, 153666, 22533, '<td valign="top">Wow, one of the best of the challenge. Clarity is great. DOF is great. Tone is great.</td>', 'Wow, one of the best of the challenge. Clarity is great. DOF is great. Tone is great.', '2005-03-19 14:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237692, 155102, 35202, '<td valign="top">great work,excellent photo!</td>', 'great work,excellent photo!', '2005-03-19 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237693, 155486, 20462, '<td valign="top">Stunning use of an idea I think many of us had.  Only you incorporate elements that raise this photo to an exceptional level.  DeSat is classically done.  But the problem with these types of shots is usually the surroundings, but you use the surroundings to your advantage.  good job.</td>', 'Stunning use of an idea I think many of us had.  Only you incorporate elements that raise this photo to an exceptional level.  DeSat is classically done.  But the problem with these types of shots is usually the surroundings, but you use the surroundings to your advantage.  good job.', '2005-03-19 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237694, 155501, 20462, '<td valign="top">At least you take the topic and make it your own.  I wish the lighting was a little more pure, but good application.  I don''t particularly like the angle/crop.</td>', 'At least you take the topic and make it your own.  I wish the lighting was a little more pure, but good application.  I don''t particularly like the angle/crop.', '2005-03-19 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237696, 155100, 20462, '<td valign="top">I like your idea.  I don''t necessarily like your crop.  But the clarity and originality are part of your capture.</td>', 'I like your idea.  I don''t necessarily like your crop.  But the clarity and originality are part of your capture.', '2005-03-19 15:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237697, 155560, 20462, '<td valign="top">weird angle, but it contributes to taking an extra look.  lines are so clearly everywhere it really is hard to go wrong.   i think the brown stuff (floor?, wall?) diminishes the effect of the image.</td>', 'weird angle, but it contributes to taking an extra look.  lines are so clearly everywhere it really is hard to go wrong.   i think the brown stuff (floor?, wall?) diminishes the effect of the image.', '2005-03-19 15:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237701, 155730, 20462, '<td valign="top">Clever, effective and really quite striking in its clarity.  There really is not much wrong with this picture only it doesn''t resonate to the point of "wow".  But thorough job all around.</td>', 'Clever, effective and really quite striking in its clarity.  There really is not much wrong with this picture only it doesn''t resonate to the point of "wow".  But thorough job all around.', '2005-03-19 15:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237702, 155568, 20462, '<td valign="top">People love to guess what these abstract things are so I will indulge myself:  I guess possibly interior of automobile.  Actually, I see circles more than lines but I personally respond to the abstract so good job.</td>', 'People love to guess what these abstract things are so I will indulge myself:  I guess possibly interior of automobile.  Actually, I see circles more than lines but I personally respond to the abstract so good job.', '2005-03-19 15:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1237704, 154164, 20462, '<td valign="top">confusion.  craziness.  but then, "ok, ok I get it".  Lines on lines. clever. I would have cropped the bottom part that starts to lay down to accentuate the lines.  Well done.</td>', 'confusion.  craziness.  but then, "ok, ok I get it".  Lines on lines. clever. I would have cropped the bottom part that starts to lay down to accentuate the lines.  Well done.', '2005-03-19 15:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
