(1237993, 153666, 8860, '<td valign="top">Quite simply - this is the winner. Hands down. I have never seen such a delightfully deep DOF as this and I can''t stop looking at it!<br/> <br/>What you''ve done is to take two perfectly ordinarily dull objects and transform them into a memorable piece of art. Your processing matches your vision perfectly - no excessive airbrushing or tasteless d+b - this is just right, albeit a slightly surreal sky. But in this shot why not?<br/> <br/>This is a print I would definitely purchase.</td>', 'Quite simply - this is the winner. Hands down. I have never seen such a delightfully deep DOF as this and I can''t stop looking at it! What you''ve done is to take two perfectly ordinarily dull objects and transform them into a memorable piece of art. Your processing matches your vision perfectly - no excessive airbrushing or tasteless d+b - this is just right, albeit a slightly surreal sky. But in this shot why not? This is a print I would definitely purchase.', '2005-03-19 20:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
