(1238974, 155625, 8522, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I''m being picky, but I really don''t see this as Polyphonic. Everything is lined up neatly in rows and columns, and if this were music it would most definitely be homophonic as everything is in a unified rhythm. There''s bad jpeg artifacting in the top right which could have been solved by saving with less compression at 150kb. Lastly, I don''t think the square crop suits this very regular composition. Some great tones here though.</td>', 'Perhaps I''m being picky, but I really don''t see this as Polyphonic. Everything is lined up neatly in rows and columns, and if this were music it would most definitely be homophonic as everything is in a unified rhythm. There''s bad jpeg artifacting in the top right which could have been solved by saving with less compression at 150kb. Lastly, I don''t think the square crop suits this very regular composition. Some great tones here though.', '2005-03-20 14:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
