(1239191, 154863, 12578, '<td valign="top">This would have looked better without being able to see the land, I would have cropped this 3/4 of the way down from the top as the greenery draws me down instead of looking at the intricacy of the overhead power cables.</td>', 'This would have looked better without being able to see the land, I would have cropped this 3/4 of the way down from the top as the greenery draws me down instead of looking at the intricacy of the overhead power cables.', '2005-03-20 17:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
