(1239199, 155759, 12578, '<td valign="top">this dosn''t quite work as a silhouette due to the light on the swings if it is meant to be, if not then I would have brought up the levels to see the lines in the fence a little better and perhaps a polarisor to bring out the blue in the sky more too.</td>', 'this dosn''t quite work as a silhouette due to the light on the swings if it is meant to be, if not then I would have brought up the levels to see the lines in the fence a little better and perhaps a polarisor to bring out the blue in the sky more too.', '2005-03-20 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
