(1239801, 155569, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nicely done Daniel.  Ouch on the score though!  I didn''t vote but I think it meets the challenge well, and I like the composition of her on the rail and the way her position contributes to the leading lines.  One thing I do think might be better is to crop the top landing, leaving just the railing, stairs, and her.  It accentuates the geometry more, though the picture as is may tell more of a story.  Regards--Neil</td>', 'Nicely done Daniel.  Ouch on the score though!  I didn''t vote but I think it meets the challenge well, and I like the composition of her on the rail and the way her position contributes to the leading lines.  One thing I do think might be better is to crop the top landing, leaving just the railing, stairs, and her.  It accentuates the geometry more, though the picture as is may tell more of a story.  Regards--Neil', '2005-03-21 00:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
