(1239826, 155382, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity, exposure, and good idea for the challenge.  <br/> <br/>You might have alternately considered a bit of a crop at the top, just above the hairline, which would have emphasized the face more, and also been in sync with the close side crop.<br/> <br/>Congrats on this great finish for your second challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity, exposure, and good idea for the challenge.   You might have alternately considered a bit of a crop at the top, just above the hairline, which would have emphasized the face more, and also been in sync with the close side crop. Congrats on this great finish for your second challenge.', '2005-03-21 00:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
