(1240092, 155461, 6388, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by librodo:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, now it can be said said that you beat me out of the ribbon race for 2005!  Well-earned, my friend.  The other challenge is still up for grabs! G''luck!<br/> <br/>Manny </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought it was first to win a blue...<br/> <br/>Well I''ll take it...it''s likely the only time I''d ever be lucky enough to beat you at much of anything related to photography :)<br/> <br/>and so you know, Manny - my score was at 7.02 about 6 hours before the challenge ended.  soooooo close :)  and my Best Friends entry doesn''t have a hope...<br/> <br/>Thanks all for the comments.  Busy loading the rest of my Thailand pix to my portfolio at the moment.  There are even a few of the Infamous Librodo in there :D</td>', 'Originally posted by librodo: Well, now it can be said said that you beat me out of the ribbon race for 2005!  Well-earned, my friend.  The other challenge is still up for grabs! G''luck! Manny   I thought it was first to win a blue... Well I''ll take it...it''s likely the only time I''d ever be lucky enough to beat you at much of anything related to photography :) and so you know, Manny - my score was at 7.02 about 6 hours before the challenge ended.  soooooo close :)  and my Best Friends entry doesn''t have a hope... Thanks all for the comments.  Busy loading the rest of my Thailand pix to my portfolio at the moment.  There are even a few of the Infamous Librodo in there :D', '2005-03-21 02:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
