(1241547, 155474, 3279, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of why entering late on Sunday evening, from a laptop, after half a bottle of wine is a bad move. It looked sharp to my eye then, but it was very obvious on Monday morning that it wasn''t and, as commenters pointed out, it really needs to be sharp.</td>', 'This is a good example of why entering late on Sunday evening, from a laptop, after half a bottle of wine is a bad move. It looked sharp to my eye then, but it was very obvious on Monday morning that it wasn''t and, as commenters pointed out, it really needs to be sharp.', '2005-03-21 17:48:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1241555, 155486, 16648, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The color/desat works well. The OOF in the foreground just helps pull you into the pic, leads your eye. I thought of doing road lines, not this good a thought though, and figured it''d be too cliche''d. A well done cliche is not a cliche!</td>', 'Very nicely done. The color/desat works well. The OOF in the foreground just helps pull you into the pic, leads your eye. I thought of doing road lines, not this good a thought though, and figured it''d be too cliche''d. A well done cliche is not a cliche!', '2005-03-21 17:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
