(1242192, 154974, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is just grand. Perhaps a tad dark for DPC voters, as they want brightness. However, I do appreciate the image and the great subdued mood it conveys. You work is interesting. This entry prompts me to place you in my fav photograher;s list as you are worthy to watch.</td>', 'This image is just grand. Perhaps a tad dark for DPC voters, as they want brightness. However, I do appreciate the image and the great subdued mood it conveys. You work is interesting. This entry prompts me to place you in my fav photograher;s list as you are worthy to watch.', '2005-03-21 23:02:34.000000', NULL, 0),
