(1242237, 154504, 22734, '<td valign="top">I simply do no understand DPc voters. There is like puritanical streak as if the days of Dr. jones are over. I have seen good model images here get voted down as if model shots are not allowed. Well, this image should have placed in the top 20.<br/> <br/>Consider: the challenge is lines. In this case the voters overlook the hard lines and the soft lines. To me, the loveliest lines are those of the human form. Look at the lines of that cheek line. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-22 00:17:05.</i></td>', 'I simply do no understand DPc voters. There is like puritanical streak as if the days of Dr. jones are over. I have seen good model images here get voted down as if model shots are not allowed. Well, this image should have placed in the top 20. Consider: the challenge is lines. In this case the voters overlook the hard lines and the soft lines. To me, the loveliest lines are those of the human form. Look at the lines of that cheek line. ', '2005-03-21 23:21:55.000000', '2005-03-22 00:17:05.000000', 0),
