(1246091, 155661, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dsidwell:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey, that IS groovy! Nice composition, Paul. That line going from bottom to top really works for me. Colors seem a bit weird, but then again, I''m colorblind! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks, so am I -- my photos often have strange colors, because I mainly worry about tone range and sometimes don''t check to see just what the color is. At least it''s not the original grayish-brown of the concrete!</td>', 'Originally posted by dsidwell: Hey, that IS groovy! Nice composition, Paul. That line going from bottom to top really works for me. Colors seem a bit weird, but then again, I''m colorblind!  Thanks, so am I -- my photos often have strange colors, because I mainly worry about tone range and sometimes don''t check to see just what the color is. At least it''s not the original grayish-brown of the concrete!', '2005-03-23 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(1246191, 154897, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hi Mark. I wanted to comment on this. You have a great composition here that fit the them of lines real well. I like your lighting. Light is what makes photography special. I think your lines here are evident. The whole frame is in good focus. I even like the texture of the wood shown here. Good work</td>', 'Hi Mark. I wanted to comment on this. You have a great composition here that fit the them of lines real well. I like your lighting. Light is what makes photography special. I think your lines here are evident. The whole frame is in good focus. I even like the texture of the wood shown here. Good work', '2005-03-23 17:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1246193, 155048, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great Selective focus. I like the composition, its bokeh style which might of been good if your title was different. I can''t really see any leaves here. maybe you should of changed the title. It is very evident though that there are leaves on the ground though, too bad we can''t see them.</td>', 'Great Selective focus. I like the composition, its bokeh style which might of been good if your title was different. I can''t really see any leaves here. maybe you should of changed the title. It is very evident though that there are leaves on the ground though, too bad we can''t see them.', '2005-03-23 17:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1246205, 153757, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract...it really does fit the theme LINES. I like your focus here. The subject isnt anything that would demand attention, but in a lines challenge, filled with abstracts, you might of had a shot here. I like the frozen rain on the branches..thats one of the most artistic natural things to shoot. Of course, Blue color always goes well with ICE. I think you did a great job here with your bokeh style background..goes well with the ice...good job</td>', 'Nice abstract...it really does fit the theme LINES. I like your focus here. The subject isnt anything that would demand attention, but in a lines challenge, filled with abstracts, you might of had a shot here. I like the frozen rain on the branches..thats one of the most artistic natural things to shoot. Of course, Blue color always goes well with ICE. I think you did a great job here with your bokeh style background..goes well with the ice...good job', '2005-03-23 17:16:57.000000', NULL, 0),
