(1247517, 155519, 12611, '<td valign="top">THis was vastly underrated and probably because most people didn''t look at it for long enough. I love how the eye is repeatedly tricked into thinking that sharp focus can be attained, when it can''t, and the way the photo looks grey-green on first impression but the tonal light is hidden. I especially like the way the sky is distorted and it looks like palm trees above the subjects head.<br/> <br/>altogether a very nice shot.</td>', 'THis was vastly underrated and probably because most people didn''t look at it for long enough. I love how the eye is repeatedly tricked into thinking that sharp focus can be attained, when it can''t, and the way the photo looks grey-green on first impression but the tonal light is hidden. I especially like the way the sky is distorted and it looks like palm trees above the subjects head. altogether a very nice shot.', '2005-03-24 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1247807, 155629, 33453, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Plain,clean and simple.</td>', 'Nice shot. Plain,clean and simple.', '2005-03-24 12:43:59.000000', NULL, 0),
