(1344090, 155639, 28742, '<td valign="top">Came across this in a forum post and noticed I gave it a 7, but left no comment. I do remember it though and thought it was very well done and particularly creative. Nice job.</td>', 'Came across this in a forum post and noticed I gave it a 7, but left no comment. I do remember it though and thought it was very well done and particularly creative. Nice job.', '2005-04-29 19:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
