(1497900, 154259, 16488, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Color blocking to make an abstraction of something people usually just walk by is one of my favorite type of images!  The diagonal shadows really make it dynamic.</td>', 'I love this!  Color blocking to make an abstraction of something people usually just walk by is one of my favorite type of images!  The diagonal shadows really make it dynamic.', '2005-07-01 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 0),
