(1625025, 154259, 18932, '<td valign="top">This is really cool - the colour of the building, the appropriateness for the challenge, the framing, the texture of the brickwork, the contrast between the yellow and the blue of the building and the blue and white of the phone booth. This one deserved the good placing, if not better.</td>', 'This is really cool - the colour of the building, the appropriateness for the challenge, the framing, the texture of the brickwork, the contrast between the yellow and the blue of the building and the blue and white of the phone booth. This one deserved the good placing, if not better.', '2005-08-19 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
