(1972095, 153666, 23394, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bitmap:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>i guess i should have submitted mine...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=158432" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/158432.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/158432.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/158432.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, you shouldn''t have. Yours is not good at all. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>well, there you have it...i made the right decision ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by Bitmap: Originally posted by skiprow: i guess i should have submitted mine...   No, you shouldn''t have. Yours is not good at all.  well, there you have it...i made the right decision ;-)', '2005-12-22 19:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1972318, 153666, 21714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bitmap:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skiprow:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>i guess i should have submitted mine...<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, you shouldn''t have. Yours is not good at all. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>well, there you have it...i made the right decision ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I don''t really know what to say to someone who is capable of scoring an eight. It''s beyond me. The best I can hope for is a seven.<br/>Good to see you get back :) You deserve it, Skip - Enjoy it!</td>', 'Originally posted by skiprow: Originally posted by Bitmap: Originally posted by skiprow: i guess i should have submitted mine...  No, you shouldn''t have. Yours is not good at all.  well, there you have it...i made the right decision ;-)  I don''t really know what to say to someone who is capable of scoring an eight. It''s beyond me. The best I can hope for is a seven.Good to see you get back :) You deserve it, Skip - Enjoy it!', '2005-12-22 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 0),
