(1985750, 155486, 37719, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this shot is amazing.  The distance you got out of the lines is incredible.  I have tried similar shots and never seem to be able to get the long look.  The processing really lets the lines stand out while at the same time not looking processed at all.  Focus is good, composition/crop is perfect.  Well done!</td>', 'The perspective on this shot is amazing.  The distance you got out of the lines is incredible.  I have tried similar shots and never seem to be able to get the long look.  The processing really lets the lines stand out while at the same time not looking processed at all.  Focus is good, composition/crop is perfect.  Well done!', '2005-12-29 08:40:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2003976, 155520, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a truly great shot, and the green to grey transition is truly perfect. There is a rythm to this shot that would certainly be missed by the untrained eye. There is no pretense here either, just nice tone.<br/> <br/>Edited out stupid comment; left less stupid one. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-24 08:57:52.</i></td>', 'This is a truly great shot, and the green to grey transition is truly perfect. There is a rythm to this shot that would certainly be missed by the untrained eye. There is no pretense here either, just nice tone. Edited out stupid comment; left less stupid one. ', '2006-01-04 17:11:06.000000', '2006-10-24 09:57:52.000000', 0),
