(3228266, 155543, 69008, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the date code thing costing you a DQ.  Lines it is, for sure. I like both of the primary elements, the pants and deck boards, and the way that the lines in the pants cut across the lines below. B&amp;W is much better than color would be for this too, as B&amp;W gives more equal weight to all the lines. The toes seem to add just the right amount of human. I would have rated this one well above average for composition, on theme, and it is just an interesting image to me. Did you try shooting with your knees a little apart to allow the deck lines to be in the middle as well?</td>', 'Bummer about the date code thing costing you a DQ.  Lines it is, for sure. I like both of the primary elements, the pants and deck boards, and the way that the lines in the pants cut across the lines below. B&W is much better than color would be for this too, as B&W gives more equal weight to all the lines. The toes seem to add just the right amount of human. I would have rated this one well above average for composition, on theme, and it is just an interesting image to me. Did you try shooting with your knees a little apart to allow the deck lines to be in the middle as well?', '2007-01-13 23:25:10.000000', NULL, 0),
